	["Chief Ukorz Sandscalp"] = "酋长乌克兹·沙头皮",
	["City of Dalaran (Forever's, {zone:1416}): {npc:246020}"] = "达拉然城（无限版本，{zone:1416}）：{npc:246020}",
	["Classes give 27 points: every class reaching 25, 45 and 60. They count once per class across your account, so a second character of a class you already raised adds nothing; a new class does. The first character to reach 25 usually unlocks the Legacy System itself."] = "职业共可获得27点：每个职业达到25、45和60级。它们在整个账号中每个职业只计一次，所以已经练过的职业再练一个角色不会增加点数；新职业则会。第一个达到25级的角色通常会解锁传承系统本身。",
	["Classes: level 25"] = "职业：25级",
