	["Durgen Dirgehammer"] = "杜根·挽歌之锤",
	["Each crafting profession gives 3 points, at 150, 225 and 300. Ranks count once per profession across your account. Follow the Polestar guide \"{skill:171} 1-300\" (Professions). A crafting profession at 150 also unlocks the Legacy System."] = "每个制造专业可获得3点，分别在150、225和300。每个等级在整个账号中每个专业只计一次。按照 Polestar 指南“{skill:171} 1-300”（专业）进行。制造专业达到150也会解锁传承系统。",
	["Edwin VanCleef"] = "埃德温·范克里夫",
	["Emperor Dagran Thaurissan"] = "达格兰·索瑞森大帝",
	["Exalted with each of the four battleground factions is worth a point. Follow the Polestar Reputation guides Warsong Gulch Reputation, Arathi Basin Reputation, Alterac Valley Reputation and Darkspear Islands Reputation (Forever's new battleground, open from level 30). The Diplomat Legacy perk increases reputation gains."] = "四个战场阵营的声望每达到一个崇拜，就能获得一点。按照 Polestar 的“战歌峡谷声望”“阿拉希盆地声望”“奥特兰克山谷声望”和“暗矛群岛声望”指南进行（暗矛群岛是无限新增战场，30 级起开放）。传承天赋“外交家”可以提高声望获取量。",
	["Exploring the entire world map on one character is a point, and it can also unlock the Legacy System. It must all be on the same character. Forever's new zones are part of the map: the {zone:2548}, {zone:2652} and {zone:2482}, a level 60 zone."] = "用同一个角色探索整张世界地图可获得一点，还能解锁传承系统。全部探索必须由同一角色完成。无限服新增地区也属于地图的一部分：{zone:2548}、{zone:2652}，以及60级地区 {zone:2482}。",
	["Follow the Polestar Exploration guides: Exploration: Eastern Kingdoms 1-30, 30-45 and 45-60, and Exploration: Kalimdor 1-30, 30-45 and 45-60. They track every area as you discover it. Exploration: Zephras Isle covers the Skyborne island; whether its map counts towards this challenge is not confirmed yet."] = "按照 Polestar 探索指南进行：“探索：东部王国1—30、30—45和45—60”，以及“探索：卡利姆多1—30、30—45和45—60”。这些指南会在你发现各区域时记录进度。“探索：泽风岛”涵盖天裔的岛屿；该地图是否计入这项挑战，尚未确认。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"{skill:164} 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "按照 Polestar 指南“{skill:164} 1-300”（专业）进行。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"{skill:165} 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "按照 Polestar 指南“{skill:165} 1-300”（专业）进行。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"{skill:197} 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "按照 Polestar 指南“{skill:197} 1-300”（专业）进行。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"{skill:202} 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "按照 Polestar 指南“{skill:202} 1-300”（专业）进行。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"{skill:333} 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "按照 Polestar 指南“{skill:333} 1-300”（专业）进行。",
	["General Drakkisath"] = "达基萨斯将军",
