	["Raids: {npc:10184}"] = "团队副本：{npc:10184}",
	["Ranks 3, 7, 10, 13 and 14 are a point each. Polestar cannot read your highest rank yet, so tick each one off yourself. Forever's honor rules for reaching a rank have not been published in detail; in Classic, ranks come from your weekly honor standing, and 13-14 take many weeks of top standing."] = "军衔3、7、10、13和14各计1点。Polestar 目前还无法读取你的最高军衔，所以请自行勾选每一项。无限 达到军衔的荣誉规则尚未详细公布；在经典版中，军衔来自你每周的荣誉排名，13-14级需要连续许多周的顶尖排名。",
	["Relic Guardian"] = "圣物守卫者",
	["Shade of Eranikus"] = "伊兰尼库斯的阴影",
	["Shade of the Archmage"] = "大法师的阴影",
	["The Field of Honor PvP season has weekly journey quests; finishing the ones for weeks 4, 7 and 10 is a point each. These quests are new in Forever and not in our data, so tick each one off yourself."] = "荣誉战场 PvP赛季有每周的旅程任务；完成第4、7和10周的任务各计1点。这些任务是 无限 新增的，不在我们的数据中，所以请自行勾选每一项。",
	["The final boss of every level 15-25 dungeon earns one point together. {area:2437} and Forever's {area:16919} (in {zone:1455}) count as one: either final boss does. Tick each boss off when you kill it, and check the in-game Legacy panel for the list."] = "击败所有 15-25 级地下城的最终首领，合计获得一点。{area:2437} 和无限的 {area:16919}（位于 {zone:1455}）算作同一个：击败任意一处的最终首领即可。每击杀一个首领就将其勾选，并在游戏内的传承面板查看列表。",
	["The final boss of every level 26-45 dungeon earns one point together. The Drowned City and {area:17780} (in the {zone:2548}) are new in Forever and not in our data: tick them off yourself."] = "所有26-45级地下城的最终首领全部击败后，共计一点。沉没之城和{area:17780}（位于{zone:2548}）是无限服新增内容，未收录在我们的数据中：请自行勾选完成。",
	["The final boss of every level 46-60 dungeon earns one point together. Alcaz Prison, {area:1216} and the {area:16985} are new in Forever and not in our data: tick them off yourself."] = "击败所有 46-60 级地下城的最终首领，合计获得一点。奥卡兹监狱、{area:1216} 和 {area:16985} 是无限新增内容，尚未收录在我们的数据中：请自行勾选。",
	["The {npc:16042} questline is a point. It is the level 60 dungeon-set chain, from An Earnest Proposition to your class's {quest:8999}: {npc:16013} ({zone:1455}) or {npc:16012} ({zone:1454}) send you through In Search of Anthion and Anthion's Parting Words to {npc:16033} at {area:254}, whose Three Kings of Flame, the Left and Right Pieces of Lord Valthalak's Amulet, Final Preparations and {quest:8995} end with {quest:8996}. {quest:8997} then leads to {quest:8999}."] = "完成 {npc:16042} 任务线可获得一点。这是 60 级地下城套装任务链，从“热心的建议”一直到你所属职业的 {quest:8999}：{npc:16013}（{zone:1455}）或 {npc:16012}（{zone:1454}）会让你依次完成“寻找安泰恩”和“告别安泰恩”，前往 {area:254} 的 {npc:16033} 处；他提供的“烈焰之王”、瓦塔拉克饰品的左半部分和右半部分、“最后的准备”及 {quest:8995}，最终通向 {quest:8996}。随后 {quest:8997} 会引向 {quest:8999}。",
	["This step cannot check the whole map by itself yet; it becomes a tracked goal once the Legacy achievement ids are recorded."] = "此步骤目前还无法自行检查整张地图；记录下传承成就的ID后，它会变成可追踪的目标。",
	["Tradeskills: {skill:164}"] = "专业技能：{skill:164}",
