	["Pick every {object:1623} (115, green, rare), {item:3357} (150, green), {item:3818} (160, green, rare), {item:3821} (170, yellow), {object:2043} (185, yellow), {item:8831} (210, orange) you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:182} 230. {item:8831} sometimes gives a {item:8153} as well. Zone level 40-50. Expect about 30 herbs for these 20 points."] = "采集沿途每一株 {object:1623}（115，绿色，稀有）、{item:3357}（150，绿色）、{item:3818}（160，绿色，稀有）、{item:3821}（170，黄色）、{object:2043}（185，黄色）、{item:8831}（210，橙色），沿路径点循环，直到 {skill:182} 达到230。采集 {item:8831} 时有时还会获得一株 {item:8153}。地区等级40—50。提升这20点预计需采集约30株草药。",
