	["Coyote, {npc:454}"] = "山狗、{npc:454}",
	["Diemetradon"] = "双帆龙",
	["Expert {skill:393}"] = "高级{skill:393}",
	["Expert {skill:393} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and no character level, and costs 50s: train it as soon as you reach 125. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:393} trainer of your faction."] = "高级{skill:393}将技能上限提高到225；需要技能125，无角色等级要求，费用50银币：达到125后立刻学习。箭头指向本阵营最近的{skill:393}训练师。",
	["Galestrider, Prideclaw"] = "疾风陆行鸟、傲爪",
	["Goretusk"] = "血牙野猪",
	["Goretusk, {npc:547}"] = "血牙野猪、{npc:547}",
	["Journeyman {skill:393}"] = "中级{skill:393}",
	["Journeyman {skill:393} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level, and costs 5s: train it as soon as you reach 50. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:393} trainer of your faction. {spell:1229517}, Forever's camping item for {skill:393}, is taught from skill 20 (1s, or free from Camping 101: {skill:393}): three {item:2318} and two {item:4470} each, it gives points until 25; placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour."] = "中级 {skill:393} 将上限提高到 150；要求技能 50，无角色等级要求，费用 5 银币：一到 50 就去学。箭头会选择本阵营最近的 {skill:393} 训练师。无限的 {skill:393} 露营物品 {spell:1229517} 在技能 20 起可学（1 银币，或通过露营 101: {skill:393} 免费学习）：每次需要三个 {item:2318} 和两个 {item:4470}，制作可涨技能至 25；放在营火旁，会给予营地内所有人持续一小时的增益。",
	["Kill and skin Cloudrunner (6), Galestrider (5), {npc:250928} (7), {npc:251284} (6), {npc:251291} (6), {npc:250873} (1), {npc:251707} (8), Prideclaw (5), {npc:250926} (3), {npc:256092} (10), {npc:253282} (8), {npc:250937} (4), Vuldren (6), {npc:250874} (10), {npc:254588} (8) along the loop until {skill:393} 50; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 1-15. Expect about 60 beasts for these 49 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥取踏云兽（6级）、疾风陆行鸟（5级）、{npc:250928}（7级）、{npc:251284}（6级）、{npc:251291}（6级）、{npc:250873}（1级）、{npc:251707}（8级）、傲爪（5级）、{npc:250926}（3级）、{npc:256092}（10级）、{npc:253282}（8级）、{npc:250937}（4级）、瓦尔德伦（6级）、{npc:250874}（10级）、{npc:254588}（8级），直到 {skill:393} 50；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，优先剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。等级为L的野兽，20级及以下所需技能为 (L-10)x10，20级以上为巨翼双足飞龙。地区等级1—15。提升这49点预计需要约60只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin Coyote (10), {npc:833} (11), {npc:454} (12), Goretusk (14), {npc:547} (16, needs 60) along the loop until {skill:393} 100; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 130 beasts for these 50 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥取山狗（10 级）、{npc:833}（11 级）、{npc:454}（12 级）、血牙野猪（14 级）、{npc:547}（16 级，需要技能 60）的皮，直到 {skill:393} 达到 100；先拾取每具尸体，再剥皮，并优先选择当前技能允许剥皮的最高等级野兽。等级为 L 的野兽，20 级及以下需要技能 (L-10)x10，更高等级需要巨翼双足飞龙。地区等级为 10-20 级。提升这 50 点预计需要约 130 只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin Worg (10), {npc:1778} (11), {npc:1766} (11), {npc:1797} (12), {npc:1923} (16, needs 60) along the loop until {skill:393} 100; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 160 beasts for these 50 points."] = "沿循环路线击杀并剥取座狼（10级）、{npc:1778}（11级）、{npc:1766}（11级）、{npc:1797}（12级）、{npc:1923}（16级，需要技能60），直到{skill:393}100；先拾取尸体再剥皮，并优先剥取当前技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽在20级及以下需要技能(L-10)x10，超过20级则需要巨翼双足飞龙。地区等级10-20。提升这50点预计需要约160只野兽。",
