	["{npc:13816} by the gate wants {npc:11946} dead: win a game in which your team kills him. Then he lets you pick a weapon ({quest:8271})."] = "门旁的{npc:13816}要你杀死{npc:11946}：赢下一场由己方击杀他的战斗。之后可选择一件武器（{quest:8271}）。",
