	["{zone:1459} is a 40 against 40 battle for level 51 and up, and the fastest of the four battleground reputations: it has about 2,000 reputation of one-time quests, and a full win pays several hundred. The same one-time quests also pay 1,870 {zone:1454} reputation. {npc:13842} stands in the {object:172982}. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1459} 是51级及以上玩家参与的40对40战场，也是四种战场声望中提升最快的一种：一次性任务约可获得2,000点声望，完整获胜一次可获得数百点。这些一次性任务还能获得1,870点 {zone:1454} 声望。{npc:13842} 站在 {object:172982} 内。无限服的传承天赋“外交家” 特长可让本指南中的所有声望数值最多提高10%。",
	["{zone:1459} is a 40 against 40 battle for level 51 and up, and the fastest of the four battleground reputations: it has about 2,000 reputation of one-time quests, and a full win pays several hundred. The same one-time quests also pay 1,870 {zone:1455} reputation. {npc:13843} recruits outside the {object:32372}. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1459} 是供 51 级及以上玩家参加的 40 对 40 战场，也是四种战场声望中提升最快的：一次性任务合计提供约 2,000 点声望，完整获胜一场可获得数百点。同一批一次性任务还会提供 1,870 点 {zone:1455} 声望。{npc:13843} 在 {object:32372} 外招募玩家。无限的传承天赋“外交家” 特权可让本指南中每个数值最多提高 10%。",
}

G["forever/reputation/arathi-basin"] = {
	["Arathi Basin Reputation"] = "阿拉希盆地声望",
	["Assault the Blacksmith banner"] = "突袭铁匠铺旗帜",
	["Assault the Farm banner"] = "突袭农场旗帜",
	["Assault the Mine banner"] = "突袭矿洞旗帜",
	["Assault the Stables banner"] = "突袭兽栏旗帜",
	["Assault the {area:3422} banner"] = "突袭 {area:3422} 的旗帜",
	["Assaulting a base means clicking its banner until it turns: you need not hold it. Four marks in all: one for {npc:14984}, three for the Brigadier General. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1461} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "突袭据点就是点击旗帜直到它转变：无需守住。总共需4枚奖章：1枚交给{npc:14984}，3枚交给准将。无限的 PvP 装备除了荣誉，也需要荣誉奖章：交还前先想好要买什么。最多携带30枚{zone:1461}奖章：达到上限前先交还或花掉。",
	["Assaulting a base means clicking its banner until it turns: you need not hold it. Four marks in all: one for {npc:15022}, three for the Warbringer. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1461} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "突袭据点只需持续点击旗帜，直到旗帜变色，不必守住。总共需要四枚奖章：一枚交给 {npc:15022}，三枚交给战争使者。无限的 PvP 装备除了荣誉，还要消耗荣誉奖章：交还前先想好要买什么。{zone:1461} 的奖章最多只能携带 30 枚：达到上限前及时交还或花掉。",
	["At Exalted, {npc:14983} asks your team to hold all five bases at the same time. It pays 200 reputation and the {item:20132}, the only way to get it."] = "达到崇拜后，{npc:14983} 会要求你的队伍同时占据全部五个基地。奖励200声望和 {item:20132}，这是取得该物品的唯一途径。",
	["At Exalted, {npc:15021} asks your team to hold all five bases at the same time. It pays 200 reputation and the {item:20131}, the only way to get it."] = "达到崇拜后，{npc:15021} 会要求你的队伍同时占据全部五个基地。奖励200声望和 {item:20131}，这是取得该物品的唯一途径。",
	["At level 60 and Friendly, {npc:14983} asks your team to hold four bases at the same time: 200 reputation, once. It opens {quest:8115} for Exalted."] = "60级且声望友善时，{npc:14983}会要求己方同时控制四个据点：一次性奖励200声望。完成后会解锁崇拜任务{quest:8115}。",
	["At level 60 and Friendly, {npc:15021} asks your team to hold four bases at the same time: 200 reputation, once. It opens {quest:8122} for Exalted."] = "60级且声望友善时，{npc:15021}会要求己方同时控制四个据点：一次性奖励200声望。完成后会解锁崇拜任务{quest:8122}。",
	["Back to {area:320}"] = "返回{area:320}",
	["Back to {area:321}"] = "回到{area:321}",
	["Every 200 resources your team gathers pays it; Exalted gives a Legacy Point, epic shoulders and the tabard."] = "你的队伍每收集200资源就会给予声望；达到崇拜可获得1点传承点数、史诗护肩和战袍。",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Arathi Basin\" and opens the epics: the level 60 Defiler's shoulders in every armor type (12g75s to 20g), {item:20068} (13g18s), {item:20069} (50g46s) and Mindfang (42g83s), both from level 55."] = "崇拜后可获得传承点数“阿拉希盆地主宰”，并解锁史诗装备：所有护甲类型的 60 级污染者肩甲（12 金 75 银至 20 金）、{item:20068}（13 金 18 银）、{item:20069}（50 金 46 银）和心灵之牙（42 金 83 银），后两者均要求 55 级。",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Arathi Basin\" and opens the epics: the level 60 Highlander's shoulders in every armor type (12g33s to 18g50s), {item:20073} (12g14s), {item:20069} (55g10s) and Sageclaw (44g24s), both from level 55."] = "崇拜后可获得传承点数“阿拉希盆地主宰”，并解锁史诗装备：所有护甲类型的 60 级高地肩甲（12 金 33 银至 18 金 50 银）、{item:20073}（12 金 14 银）、{item:20069}（55 金 10 银）和先知之爪（44 金 24 银），后两者均要求 55 级。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation, about 40 wins at the Classic rate. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:15126} beside {npc:15021}: the {item:20072} trinket for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (72s to 4g12s), and food and bandages that work in {zone:1461} (10s to 20s). He also gives one Defiler's care package at Friendly (pick the one for your level): 10 reputation and a bag of battleground food and bandages."] = "从友善到尊敬需要 6000 点声望，按经典旧世倍率约需 40 胜。友善后，{npc:15021} 旁的 {npc:15126} 会解锁首批奖励：适用于 28、38、48 和 58 级的 {item:20072} 饰品（72 银至 4 金 12 银），以及可在 {zone:1461} 使用的食物和绷带（10 银至 20 银）。友善时他还会给一份污染者的医疗包（选择适合自己等级的一份）：奖励 10 点声望，以及一袋战场食物和绷带。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation, about 40 wins at the Classic rate. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:15127} beside {npc:14983}: the {item:20071} trinket for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (72s to 4g12s), and food and bandages that work in {zone:1461} (10s to 20s). He also gives one Arathor care package at Friendly (pick the one for your level): 10 reputation and a bag of battleground food and bandages."] = "友善到尊敬需要 6000 点声望，按经典怀旧服的获取速度约需获胜 40 次。友善后可在 {npc:14983} 身边的 {npc:15127} 处购买首批奖励：适合 28、38、48 和 58 级的饰品 {item:20071}（72 银至 4 金 12 银），以及仅在 {zone:1461} 可用的食物和绷带（10 至 20 银币）。友善时，他还会给予一份阿拉索补给包（选适合自己等级的）：奖励 10 点声望，以及一袋战场食物和绷带。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation, about 80 wins. Honored opens the Defiler's belts in plate, lamellar, chain, mail, leather, lizardhide and cloth for levels 28 to 58 (75s to 8g78s)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000声望，约80场胜利。尊敬后可购买28至58级的污染者腰带，有板甲、板层甲、链甲、锁甲、皮甲、蜥蜴皮和布甲（75银至8金78银）。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation, about 80 wins. Honored opens the Highlander's belts in plate, lamellar, chain, mail, leather, lizardhide and cloth for levels 28 to 58 (72s to 8g84s)."] = "从尊敬到崇敬需要12000点声望，约80次胜利。尊敬可解锁高地人的板甲、板层甲、链甲、锁甲、皮甲、蜥蜴皮和布甲腰带，适用于28到58级（72银币至8金币84银币）。",
	["League of Arathor to Exalted"] = "阿拉索联军刷到崇拜",
	["League of Arathor to Friendly"] = "阿拉索联军刷到友善",
	["League of Arathor to Honored"] = "阿拉索联军刷到尊敬",
	["League of Arathor to Revered"] = "阿拉索联军刷到崇敬",
	["Master of Arathi Basin: a Legacy Point at Exalted"] = "阿拉希盆地大师：达到崇拜获得1点传承点数",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. In Classic a win paid 100 and its 3 marks bring 50 more at the Brigadier General ({quest:8374}, again and again): about 150 a win, some 20 wins. Forever has not published its battleground rates, so count the games as a rough guide. Below level 50 the quests at {area:320} come in a version for your bracket (from level 20): 200 for assaulting the bases, 200 for one mark, then 100 and 50 per 3 marks at the Brigadier General."] = "从中立到友善需要3000点声望。经典版中，胜利奖励100点，3枚奖章交给准将还能获得50点（{quest:8374}，可反复交还）：每次胜利约150点，约需20胜。无限服尚未公布战场声望倍率，因此场次只能作为粗略参考。50级以下时，{area:320} 的任务会提供适合你等级段的版本（20级起）：突袭基地奖励200点，首枚奖章奖励200点，之后准将每收取3枚奖章，首次奖励100点，后续每次50点。",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. In Classic a win paid 100 and its 3 marks bring 50 more at the Warbringer ({quest:8370}, again and again): about 150 a win, some 20 wins. Forever has not published its battleground rates, so count the games as a rough guide. Below level 50 the quests at {area:321} come in a version for your bracket (from level 20): 200 for assaulting the bases, 200 for one mark, then 100 and 50 per 3 marks at the Warbringer."] = "从中立到友善需要 3000 点声望。经典旧世中，获胜提供 100 点，3 枚奖章可在战争使者处再换 50 点（{quest:8370}，可反复完成）：每胜一场约 150 点，大约需要 20 胜。无限尚未公布战场声望倍率，因此场数仅供粗略参考。50 级以下，{area:321} 的任务会提供适合你等级段的版本（20 级起）：突袭基地提供 200 点，一枚奖章提供 200 点，随后在战争使者处每 3 枚奖章先换 100 点、再换 50 点。",
	["Reputation · Battlegrounds"] = "声望 · 战场",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, about 140 wins: half of the whole climb. Revered opens the Defiler's boots and greaves for levels 28 to 58 (1g12s to 13g41s), the ones with the run-speed bonus."] = "从崇敬到崇拜需要21000声望，大约140场胜利，占整个冲声望过程的一半。崇敬后可购买28至58级的 污染者的 靴子和护胫（1金币12银币至13金币41银币），就是带移动速度加成的那些。",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, about 140 wins: half of the whole climb. Revered opens the Highlander's boots and greaves for levels 28 to 58 (1g7s to 13g65s), the ones with the run-speed bonus."] = "从崇敬到崇拜需要21000点声望，约140次胜利：相当于整个声望进程的一半。崇敬可解锁适用于28到58级的高地人长靴和胫甲（1金币7银币至13金币65银币），它们附带奔跑速度加成。",
	["all five bases held at once"] = "同时控制全部5处据点",
	["four bases held at once"] = "同时控制四处基地。",
	["hand in the three marks first"] = "先交还三枚奖章",
	["one {item:20559}"] = "一枚 {item:20559}",
	["three more marks"] = "再收集3枚奖章",
	["{faction:510} to Exalted"] = "{faction:510}刷到崇拜",
	["{faction:510} to Friendly"] = "{faction:510}刷到友善",
	["{faction:510} to Honored"] = "{faction:510}刷到尊敬",
	["{faction:510} to Revered"] = "{faction:510}刷到崇敬",
	["{npc:14983}: assault four bases, 200"] = "{npc:14983}：突袭四处基地，200 点声望。",
	["{npc:14984}: one mark, 200"] = "{npc:14984}：一枚奖章，200 点声望",
	["{npc:15021}: assault four bases, 200"] = "{npc:15021}：突袭四处基地，200 点声望。",
	["{npc:15022}: one mark, 200"] = "{npc:15022}：一枚奖章，200 点声望",
	["{npc:15126}: Exalted rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：崇拜奖励",
	["{npc:15126}: Friendly rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：友善奖励",
	["{npc:15126}: Honored rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：尊敬奖励",
	["{npc:15126}: Revered rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：崇敬奖励",
	["{npc:15127}: Exalted rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：崇拜奖励",
	["{npc:15127}: Friendly rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：友善奖励",
	["{npc:15127}: Honored rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：尊敬奖励",
	["{npc:15127}: Revered rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：崇敬奖励",
	["{npc:15350}: 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15350}：3枚徽章换50声望",
	["{npc:15350}: three marks, 100"] = "{npc:15350}：三枚奖章，100 点声望",
	["{npc:15350}: {quest:8370} again, 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15350}：再次交还 {quest:8370}，3 枚奖章换 50 点声望",
	["{npc:15351}: 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15351}：3枚徽章换50声望",
	["{npc:15351}: three marks, 100"] = "{npc:15351}：三枚奖章，100 点声望",
	["{npc:15351}: {quest:8374} again, 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15351}：再次交还 {quest:8374}，3 枚奖章换 50 点声望",
	["{zone:1461} is a 15 against 15 battle over five bases, from level 20: hold bases to gather resources, and the first team to 2000 wins. Queue at any battlemaster in the capitals or from the battleground screen. In Classic every 200 resources your team gathers pay everyone 10 reputation, so a win pays 100 and a close loss nearly as much; a game also pays 3 Arathi Basin Marks of Honor for a win, 1 for a loss. The three quests here pay 500 reputation together (200, 200 and 100), once. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1461} 是20级起可参与的15对15战场，围绕五座基地展开：占领基地以收集资源，率先达到2000资源的队伍获胜。可找主城内任意战场军官或通过战场界面排队。经典版中，己方每收集200资源，每人获得10点声望，因此胜利可得100点，比分接近的失败也几乎一样；每局获胜奖励3枚阿拉希盆地荣誉奖章，失败奖励1枚。这里的三个一次性任务合计奖励500点声望（200、200和100）。无限服的传承天赋“外交家” 特长可让本指南中的所有声望数值最多提高10%。",
}

G["forever/reputation/argent-dawn"] = {
	["Araj the Summoner"] = "召唤者阿拉基",
	["Archivist Galford"] = "档案员加尔福德",
	["Argent Dawn Reputation"] = "银色黎明声望",
	["Argent Dawn Valor Tokens"] = "银色黎明勇气勋章",
	["Argent Dawn Valor Tokens, from the stone turn-ins"] = "银色黎明勇气勋章，通过交还天灾石获得",
	["At Exalted, {npc:11536} takes 25 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens for the {quest:5517} (150 reputation): +5 to every resistance, on your shoulders. After it, the quartermasters sell more for 40 gold each."] = "崇拜后，{npc:11536} 会收取 25 枚银色黎明勇气勋章，完成 {quest:5517}（150 点声望）：肩部附魔，所有抗性 +5。之后军需官会以每个 40 金币出售更多。",
	["At Revered, {npc:11536} takes 10 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens for {quest:5504} (100 reputation). After it, any {faction:529} quartermaster sells the five shoulder enchants for 10 gold each: Flame, Frost, Arcane, Nature and {item:18173}, +5 to that resistance. Revered also opens the {item:13810} and its juice (60 silver) and the Revered recipes."] = "达到崇敬后，{npc:11536} 会收取 10 枚银色黎明勇气勋章，用于完成 {quest:5504}（100 点声望）。完成后，任意 {faction:529} 军需官都会出售五种肩部附魔，每种 10 金币：火焰、冰霜、奥术、自然和 {item:18173}，对应抗性 +5。崇敬还会解锁 {item:13810} 及其果汁（60 银）和崇敬配方。",
	["Back at {area:2268}"] = "回到{area:2268}",
	["Dark Adept"] = "黑暗专家",
	["Dark Adepts and Shadowmages at {area:2272}"] = "{area:2272} 的黑暗教徒和暗影法师",
	["Ectoplasmic Resonators: the ghosts around the cauldron"] = "外膜震荡体：大锅周围的幽灵",
	["Every Scourge kill in the Plaguelands gives 5 reputation (named ones 15), from the level 50 ghouls and skeletons up; at level 60 pick the level 53 and up ones, since in Classic grey mobs give only about a fifth. Neutral to Friendly is 2,800: about 560 kills, fewer with the Plaguelands quests on the way. The densest Scourge stand around the four Scourge Cauldrons: {area:199} west of Andorhal (skeletons, 50-53), {area:200} north of Andorhal (zombies and ghouls, 52-55), the {area:202} in the south (ghouls, 54-55) and {area:201} in the east (ghosts, 56-57). Keep every Scourgestone and every quest you can save: turn-ins never stop counting, kills do. {quest:5510} drop from about four in ten of these Scourge, Invader's from about a third of the level 56 and up ones. If you die, take the Commission off and put it back on: it can lose its effect. Paladins (Human and Dwarf): {npc:10838} at {area:3197} asks 20 {quest:5510} once for Dispelling Evil, 100 reputation instead of 25. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "在瘟疫之地，每击杀一只天灾怪物获得5声望（有名字的怪物15），从50级食尸鬼和骷髅起都算；60级时应选53级及以上的，因为经典旧世中灰色怪物只提供约五分之一声望。从中立到友善需要2,800声望：大约560次击杀，沿途做瘟疫之地任务可减少所需击杀数。天灾最密集的地方在四口瘟疫之锅周围：安多哈尔西面的 {area:199}（骷髅，50—53级）、安多哈尔北面的 {area:200}（僵尸和食尸鬼，52—55级）、南面的 {area:202}（食尸鬼，54—55级）和东面的 {area:201}（幽灵，56—57级）。保留所有天灾石，并尽可能留着任务：交还始终能获得声望，击杀则有上限。这些天灾怪物掉落 {quest:5510} 的概率约为十分之四；56级及以上怪物掉落侵略者的天灾石的概率约为三分之一。如果死亡，请卸下委任徽章再重新装备：它可能会失效。圣骑士（人类和矮人）：{area:3197} 的 {npc:10838} 会在“驱散邪恶”中一次性索要20个 {quest:5510}，奖励100声望，而非25。传承特权外交家会使每次声望获取最多提高10%。",
	["Friendly to Honored: stones and named Scourge"] = "友善到尊敬：天灾石与有名的天灾怪",
	["Gish the Unmoving"] = "不动的基什",
	["Hed'mush the Rotting"] = "腐烂的赫德穆什",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000: about 2,400 {area:2057} and {area:2279} mobs, fewer with their bosses. Their mobs stop at 11,999 of 12,000 Honored; a boss or a turn-in takes you over. Solo, only Scourgestones, the cauldron deliveries and Araj count: 12,000 is 480 turn-ins, or 4,800 {quest:5509}. Keep the stones you get in the dungeons until their mobs stop counting. Honored opens recipes at all three quartermasters: {npc:11536} at {area:2268}, {npc:10857} at {area:3197}, {npc:10856} at the {area:152}. Also the {item:22014} (133 gold) for the Three Kings of Flame quest."] = "从尊敬到崇敬需要12,000点：约需击杀2,400只 {area:2057} 和 {area:2279} 的普通怪，如果也击杀首领则更少。普通怪到尊敬12,000中的11,999点便停止提供声望；再击杀首领或交还一次物品即可跨过门槛。单人只有天灾石、瘟疫之锅材料交付和阿拉基还能提供声望：12,000点相当于480次交还，或4,800颗 {quest:5509}。地下城中获得的天灾石先保留，等普通怪不再提供声望后再交。尊敬可解锁三位军需官的配方：{area:2268} 的 {npc:11536}、{area:3197} 的 {npc:10857}、{area:152} 的 {npc:10856}。还可购买“烈焰之王”任务需要的 {item:22014}（133金币）。",
	["Honored to Revered: dungeons and stones"] = "尊敬到崇敬：地下城与天灾石",
	["Hungering Wraith"] = "饥饿的怨灵",
	["Hungering Wraiths at {area:201}; any Scourge counts"] = "{area:201} 的饥饿的鬼魂；任何天灾军团怪物都算",
	["Lord Darkscythe"] = "暗镰领主",
	["Neutral to Friendly: Scourge of the {zone:1422}"] = "中立到友善：{zone:1422} 的天灾军团",
	["Normal Scourge outside the dungeons stop giving reputation halfway through Friendly (3,000 of 6,000); {npc:10826}, {npc:10821} and {npc:10825} stop at the end of Friendly. After that only Araj, the {area:2057} and {area:2279} mobs, the cauldron deliveries and Scourgestones count. Now turn in the stones you saved: {npc:11039} at {area:2268} takes all three kinds, and so do the officers at {area:3197} and the {area:152}. Every turn-in pays 25 and an {item:12844}: keep 35 tokens for the mantles at Revered and Exalted. {quest:5509} are worth twice as much per stone: the Dark Adepts, Shadowmages, Dread Weavers and Scourge Champions (level 58-60) at {area:2272}, just north of {area:2268}, drop them about a third of the time or more, next to the turn-in. The named Scourge below drop a {item:12843} half the time or more ({npc:1850} two times in three, Araj and {npc:10821} half the time) and give 15 a kill, Araj until Exalted; {npc:1850} gives no reputation, only the stone. Friendly opens the Enriched Manna Biscuits (60 silver) at the quartermasters."] = "地下城外的普通天灾怪在友善过半后（6,000中的3,000）就不再奖励声望；{npc:10826}、{npc:10821} 和 {npc:10825} 在友善结束时停止。之后只有阿拉基、{area:2057} 和 {area:2279} 的怪物、瘟疫之锅材料交付以及天灾石还能提供声望。现在交还之前攒下的天灾石：{area:2268} 的 {npc:11039} 接受全部三种，{area:3197} 和 {area:152} 的军官也一样。每次交还奖励25点和一个 {item:12844}：保留35个徽章，用于崇敬和崇拜的衬肩。{quest:5509} 每颗的声望价值是另一种的两倍：{area:2268} 正北方 {area:2272} 的黑暗教徒、暗影法师、恐怖编织者和天灾勇士（58—60级）约有三分之一或更高概率掉落，且就在交还点旁边。下列有名的天灾怪至少有一半概率掉落 {item:12843}（{npc:1850} 为三分之二，阿拉基和 {npc:10821} 为一半），每次击杀还奖励15点，阿拉基可一直奖励到崇拜；{npc:1850} 不奖励声望，只掉天灾石。友善可在军需官处购买可口的魔法点心（60银币）。",
	["Plagued Flesh Samples: the Scourge inside"] = "瘟疫肉块：由内部的天灾怪物掉落",
	["Plagued Hatchling"] = "瘟疫雏龙",
	["Plaguelands quests and the Scourge Cauldrons"] = "瘟疫之地任务与瘟疫之锅",
	["Putridius"] = "普特里迪乌斯",
	["Recipes for Tailors, Leatherworkers, Blacksmiths, Enchanters and Alchemists from Honored and Revered"] = "尊敬和崇敬时可获得裁缝、制皮、锻造、附魔和炼金术配方",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Revered to Exalted"] = "崇敬到崇拜",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 840 Scourgestone or cauldron turn-ins, or the dungeon bosses with their {quest:5508} (a full {area:2057} clear is about 600). Turn in every stone and {item:13920} you saved."] = "从崇敬到崇拜需要 21,000 点：相当于交还 840 次天灾石或大锅任务，也可以击杀地下城首领并完成对应的 {quest:5508}（完整清理一次 {area:2057} 约提供 600 点）。把之前留存的所有天灾石和 {item:13920} 都交掉。",
	["Scourgestones, {area:2057} and {area:2279}: the shoulder resistance enchants and a dozen recipes."] = "天灾石、{area:2057}和{area:2279}：肩部抗性附魔和十几种配方。",
	["Soulless Ghoul"] = "无魂食尸鬼",
	["Soulless Ghouls at the {area:202}"] = "{area:202} 的没有灵魂的食尸鬼",
	["The Plaguelands quests pay in full at 60 from level 55 up and never stop counting, about 1,500 in all; the leveling guides walk them. The cauldron chain from {npc:11053} at {area:3197} (Horde: {npc:11055} at the {area:152}): 150 per cauldron with its return ({area:199}'s pair is level 53: in Classic it pays three fifths at 60), then Mission Accomplished! 200. Alas, Andorhal 150 ({npc:1852}, elite). At {area:2268}, {npc:11063}'s {area:2262} quests (Brother Carlin 50 from Chromie in Andorhal, Villains of Darrowshire 100, Marauders of Darrowshire 100) and {npc:10926}'s Hidden Treasures 200 at the end of the {area:2262} story; {npc:12250} 75 from {npc:11038}. After Mission Accomplished!, each cauldron takes a repeatable delivery: 25 reputation every time, until Exalted. {npc:11056} at {area:3197} (Horde: {npc:11057} at the {area:152}) gives you a {item:13370}, without which the reagents never drop, and sells Arcane Quickeners for 50 silver (one per delivery; it crumbles after 30 minutes, so buy it last). Each delivery also takes 4 {item:14047}. Farm {area:201}: its ghosts drop an {item:13354} about one time in four, so about 16 kills fill a delivery; the other cauldrons want 5 or 6 reagents that drop one time in ten or less. Once the Plaguelands Scourge stop counting, this earns about four times what their Scourgestones alone do."] = "瘟疫之地的任务在60级时从55级起就全额给，且永远算数，总共约1,500；升级指南会带你做。{area:3197}的{npc:11053}（部落：{area:152}的{npc:11055}）的瘟疫锅系列：每口瘟疫锅连同回程给150（{area:199}那一对是53级：经典旧世中60级时只给五分之三），然后是“任务完成！”给200。接着是“唉，安多哈尔”150（{npc:1852}，精英）。在{area:2268}，{npc:11063}的{area:2262}任务（卡林兄弟50，来自安多哈尔的克罗米；达尔隆郡的恶棍100；达尔隆郡的掠夺者100）和{npc:10926}在{area:2262}故事末尾的“隐藏的宝藏”200；{npc:12250}给75，来自{npc:11038}。完成“任务完成！”后，每口瘟疫锅可重复交付：每次25声望，直到崇拜。{area:3197}的{npc:11056}（部落：{area:152}的{npc:11057}）会给你一个{item:13370}，没有它材料永远不会掉落；他还以50银出售奥术催化剂（每次交付一个；30分钟后碎裂，所以最后再买）。每次交付还需4个{item:14047}。刷{area:201}：其中的鬼魂约四分之一几率掉{item:13354}，所以约16杀够一次交付；其他瘟疫锅需要5或6种材料，掉落率十分之一或更低。一旦瘟疫之地的天灾停止计数，这比单交它们的天灾石多赚约四倍。",
	["the cauldron at {area:201}"] = "{area:201} 的瘟疫之锅",
	["{area:2057} lies under {area:2298}, the island town in the south-east of the {zone:1422}; your side's {area:2057} quests give the {item:13704} that opens it. It is the best {faction:529} run: its mobs give 5 up to the last point of Honored, and its thirteen bosses about 375 reputation a full clear plus ten or so {quest:5508} (about 250 more). {npc:10508} and {npc:1853} give 50 each."] = "{area:2057} 位于 {zone:1422} 东南方岛上城镇 {area:2298} 的地下；本阵营的 {area:2057} 任务会奖励开门用的 {item:13704}。这是刷 {faction:529} 声望最好的地下城：普通怪每只奖励5点，直到尊敬阶段的最后一点之前；十三名首领完整清理约奖励375点，再加上大约十个 {quest:5508}（约额外250点）。{npc:10508} 和 {npc:1853} 每名奖励50点。",
	["{area:2268} quests"] = "{area:2268}的任务",
	["{area:2268}, on the east side of the {zone:1423}, is the {faction:529}'s home: {npc:11039}, {npc:11035} and {npc:243254} give its dungeon quests, 100 to 200 reputation each and about 1,700 in all. They are group quests for {area:2279} and {area:2057} (level 58-60, five players): take the ones your group will run. The Duke's chain ends at the {object:176317}, a chest of {faction:529} gear."] = "{area:2268} 位于 {zone:1423} 东部，是 {faction:529} 的据点：{npc:11039}、{npc:11035} 和 {npc:243254} 会提供地下城任务，每个奖励100到200点声望，总计约1,700点。这些是 {area:2279} 和 {area:2057} 的组队任务（58—60级，五人）：只接你的小队要去的地下城对应的任务。公爵的任务线最终奖励 {object:176317}，这是装有 {faction:529} 装备的箱子。",
	["{area:2279} is a group of five at the north end of the {zone:1423}. Its Scourge give 5 reputation a kill up to the last point of Honored, and its Scourge bosses 25 until Exalted ({npc:10440} 50), each with a {item:12843}. The Black Guard Sentries by the Baron give 5 until Exalted. The Scourge side, through the service entrance, pays far more than the Scarlet side."] = "{area:2279} 是位于 {zone:1423} 最北端的五人地下城。其中的天灾怪物每只提供 5 点声望，直到尊敬的最后一点；天灾首领每只提供 25 点，直到崇拜（{npc:10440} 提供 50 点），而且各掉落一个 {item:12843}。男爵旁的黑衣卫哨兵每只提供 5 点，直到崇拜。从后门进入的天灾区，比血色区提供的声望多得多。",
	["{item:12843}: the named Scourge below, and dungeon bosses"] = "{item:12843}：来自下方列出的具名天灾怪物和地下城首领。",
	["{item:13180}: the supply crates"] = "{item:13180}：补给箱",
	["{item:13320}, 50 silver"] = "{item:13320}，50银币",
	["{item:13482} ({skill:171}), 1 gold 50 silver"] = "{item:13482}（{skill:171}），1 金 50 银",
	["{item:18170}: pick the resistance you need, 10 gold"] = "{item:18170}：选择所需抗性，10金币",
	["{item:19203} ({skill:164}), 2 gold 20 silver"] = "{item:19203}（{skill:164}），2 金 20 银",
	["{item:19205} ({skill:164}), 4 gold"] = "{item:19205}（{skill:164}），4 金",
	["{item:19216} ({skill:197}), 2 gold 20 silver"] = "{item:19216}（{skill:197}），2 金 20 银",
	["{item:19217} ({skill:197}), 4 gold"] = "{item:19217}（{skill:197}），4 金",
	["{item:19328} ({skill:165}), 2 gold 20 silver"] = "{item:19328}（{skill:165}），2 金 20 银",
	["{item:19329} ({skill:165}), 4 gold"] = "{item:19329}（{skill:165}），4 金",
	["{item:19442} ({skill:129}), 10 gold"] = "{item:19442}（{skill:129}），10 金",
	["{item:19446}, 3 gold"] = "{item:19446}，3 金",
	["{item:19447}, 6 gold"] = "{item:19447}，6 金",
	["{npc:10811}, Scarlet side"] = "{npc:10811}，血色区",
	["{npc:10839} stands at the {area:152}, on the road from {zone:1420} into the {zone:1422}. {object:2160} starts at Neutral 200 for everyone. Wear the Commission trinket while you fight the Scourge: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it. {npc:11039} at {area:2268} gives the same Commission; you can only take one."] = "{npc:10839} 站在 {area:152}，位于从 {zone:1420} 通往 {zone:1422} 的路上。所有人的 {object:2160} 起始声望均为中立200点。与天灾作战时要装备委任徽章饰品：只有佩戴时才会掉落天灾石。{area:2268} 的 {npc:11039} 也会提供同样的委任徽章；只能领取一个。",
	["{npc:10840} stands in {area:3197}, in the south of the {zone:1422}. {object:2160} starts at Neutral 200 for everyone. Wear the Commission trinket while you fight the Scourge: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it. {npc:11039} at {area:2268} gives the same Commission; you can only take one."] = "{npc:10840} 站在 {zone:1422} 南部的 {area:3197}。所有人的 {object:2160} 声望都从中立 200 点开始。与天灾军团战斗时要装备委任徽章饰品：只有戴着它才会掉落天灾石。{area:2268} 的 {npc:11039} 也会给予相同的委任徽章；只能领取其中一个。",
	["{npc:11056}: ask for a {item:13370}"] = "{npc:11056}：索取一个 {item:13370}。",
	["{npc:11057}, at the {area:152}: ask for a {item:13370}"] = "{area:152} 的 {npc:11057}：索取一个 {item:13370}",
	["{npc:1850}, {zone:1422}: the stone only"] = "{npc:1850}，{zone:1422}：只取石头",
	["{npc:1852}, Andorhal"] = "{npc:1852}，安多哈尔",
	["{quest:5212} leads to {quest:5213} (the {item:13176} in a {area:2279} ziggurat), which rewards the {item:13209} or the {item:19812}: better trinkets that also make Scourgestones drop, so they can replace the Commission. {quest:5251} leads on to the {item:13250} and {npc:10440}. A {item:13920}, a rare drop (about 6%) from the {quest:5529} once {quest:5529} is done, starts a quest worth 50 each time: keep them until Revered. {npc:10267} in the {zone:1428}, at the end of her {area:1583} quests, sends you to {npc:243254} (75) and on to {npc:11035}'s {item:12368} in {area:2057} (25 and 200)."] = "{quest:5212} 后续是 {quest:5213}（获取 {area:2279} 通灵塔中的 {item:13176}），奖励 {item:13209} 或 {item:19812}：它们是更好的饰品，同样能让怪物掉落天灾石，因此可以替代委任徽章。{quest:5251} 会继续引向 {item:13250} 和 {npc:10440}。完成 {quest:5529} 后，{quest:5529} 有较低概率（约 6%）掉落 {item:13920}，可开启一个每次提供 50 点声望的任务：留到崇敬再交。{zone:1428} 的 {npc:10267} 在她的 {area:1583} 任务链末尾，会让你去找 {npc:243254}（75 点），再前往 {area:2057} 获取 {npc:11035} 所需的 {item:12368}（25 点和 200 点）。",
	["{quest:5401} (Alliance)"] = "{quest:5401}（联盟）",
	["{quest:5401} (Horde)"] = "{quest:5401}（部落）",
	["{quest:5508}: 1 for 25 reputation"] = "{quest:5508}：1个换25声望",
	["{quest:5509}: 10 for 25 reputation"] = "{quest:5509}：10 个换 25 点声望",
	["{quest:5510}: 20 for 25 reputation"] = "{quest:5510}：20 个换取 25 点声望。",
	["{quest:5510}: keep them"] = "{quest:5510}：留着它们",
	["{quest:5529}, in the hatchery"] = "{quest:5529}，在孵化间内",
}

G["forever/reputation/bloodsail-buccaneers"] = {
	["\"Pretty Boy\" Duncan, a Bloodsail pirate, stands on the beach north of {area:35}. {area:35} players kill him for a quest: if he is not there, wait for him. He has a quest for you from level 55, while {area:35} is below Neutral; it is done once you are Friendly with the Bloodsail and Hated with {area:35}."] = "血帆海盗帅小伙子邓肯站在 {area:35} 北边的海滩上。{area:35} 的玩家会为了任务杀他：如果不在，就等他刷新。从55级起，且 {area:35} 声望低于中立时，他会给你任务；血帆声望达到友善、{area:35} 声望达到仇恨后即可完成。",
	["At Neutral the Bloodsail crew stop attacking you. {npc:2546} is aboard the {area:1757}, the pirate ship anchored south of {area:35}, on its middle deck. Swim out; take the quest and hand it in on the spot for the {item:22746}: the {item:22742}, Sash, Pants and Boots."] = "达到中立后，血帆船员就不会再攻击你。{npc:2546} 位于 {area:1757}，这是停泊在 {area:35} 南边的海盗船，他在中层甲板。游过去；现场接取并交还任务，获得 {item:22746}：内含 {item:22742}、腰带、长裤和靴子。",
	["Back to Firallon for the {item:12185} (in Classic its use calls a parrot to your shoulder): 200 more Bloodsail and 1,000 less {area:35}. Bruisers pay 25 only up to the end of Honored and Jazzrik, a lone goblin in the {zone:1418}, 5 up to the end of Revered; no quest is left, so Exalted cannot be reached."] = "回去找舰队指挥官菲尔拉伦领取{item:12185}（经典版中使用后会在肩上召唤一只鹦鹉）：再获得200血帆声望，并损失1,000点{area:35}声望。卫兵每个奖励25，但最多只能到尊敬末尾；{zone:1418}独居的地精加兹里克每次奖励5，最多到崇敬末尾；此后已无任务可做，因此无法达到崇拜。",
	["Baron Revilgaz"] = "雷维尔加兹男爵",
	["Before you start"] = "开始之前",
	["Bloodsail Buccaneers Reputation"] = "血帆海盗声望",
	["Bloodsail standing goes up only by killing the people of {area:35}, and every kill costs you {area:35} 125 and the other goblin towns ({area:976}, {area:392}, {area:2255}, and in Forever likely Powderfuse) about 62 each. After the Bruisers this guide asks for, every goblin town is Hated: their guards attack you, and you lose their flight masters, inns, vendors and {area:976}'s and {area:2255}'s auction houses. Getting back takes longer than getting here (last step). Fly in, bind elsewhere, and do your goblin-town business first. The outfit and the hat need only Friendly; past that Bloodsail has nothing to give. {area:35}'s guards are not your enemies yet: tick At War for {area:35} in your reputation panel, then attack."] = "血帆海盗声望只能靠击杀 {area:35} 的居民提升，每次击杀都会使 {area:35} 声望降低 125，其他地精城镇（{area:976}、{area:392}、{area:2255}，以及无限中可能还有爆破引线港）的声望各降低约 62。按本指南要求击杀卫兵后，所有地精城镇都会对你仇恨：守卫会攻击你，你将无法使用它们的飞行管理员、旅店、商人，以及 {area:976} 和 {area:2255} 的拍卖行。恢复声望比刷到这里更费时（见最后一步）。先飞过来，把炉石绑定在别处，并提前办完地精城镇里的事。服装和帽子只需友善；继续提升血帆声望没有额外奖励。{area:35} 的守卫目前还不是你的敌人：先在声望面板中勾选与 {area:35}“交战”，再攻击。",
	["Booty Bay Bruiser"] = "藏宝海湾打手",
	["Booty Bay Bruisers to Neutral"] = "击杀藏宝海湾地精卫兵直到中立",
	["Bruisers to Friendly"] = "击杀卫兵至友善",
	["Every goblin town is now Hated. Forever's quest data takes the town reputation off the four goblin amends quests outside {area:392}, {area:35}, {area:976} and {area:2255}, so the climb back is the Cartel's own: {npc:14637} in {zone:1444} serves everyone, and his Zapped Giants quests pay 25 to every town at once; Bloodsail pirates give {area:35} 5 each up to the end of Neutral (and cost Bloodsail 25); Southsea pirates and the Venture Co. in Stranglethorn give the towns 5 each. The Steamwheedle Cartel guide has the details. Expect it to take longer than the war did."] = "现在所有地精城镇对你都是仇恨。无限服的任务数据移除了{area:392}、{area:35}、{area:976}和{area:2255}外四个地精赎罪任务的城镇声望奖励，因此恢复声望得走热砂港自己的途径：{zone:1444}的{npc:14637}为所有人提供任务，他的“被缩小的巨人”任务每次同时为所有城镇增加25声望；血帆海盗每个增加5点{area:35}声望，最多到中立末尾（同时扣除25血帆声望）；南海海盗和荆棘谷的风险投资公司成员每个增加5点城镇声望。详见热砂港声望指南。预计恢复声望要比先前开战花更久。",
	["Fleet Master Seahorn"] = "舰队指挥官西霍恩",
	["Look at your Bloodsail bar first. A new character starts Hated, 500 short of Hostile: 260 Bruisers to Neutral, at 25 each. But every {area:35} quest you did while leveling took five times its {area:35} reward off Bloodsail (An OOX of Your Own, Stranglethorn Fever and Facing Negolash 1,000 each), and every Bloodsail pirate you killed 25 more: after {area:35}'s quests you sit near the bottom of Hated, up to 1,680 Bruisers from Neutral. Divide what the bar still lacks to Hostile, plus 6,000, by 25. Bruisers (level 57) hit hard, net you and knock you back, and new ones come when a goblin calls for help. Fight on the path that turns left from the tunnel up to the blacksmith's house: two Bruisers patrol it and rarely meet. Once they are down, step into the house (or hit one of the goblins inside) and a fresh Bruiser comes running. Players manage 30 to 40 an hour. {area:35} is Hated after about 53 Bruisers from a fresh Neutral 500. At the New Year celebration the town's goblins are drunk and do not fight back. The Blackwater crew at {area:327} in the {zone:1417} (level 37-40) are easier but pay only 5 each. Do not kill Bloodsail pirates: each costs 25."] = "先看血帆声望条。新角色初始为仇恨，距敌对还差 500 点：每名卫兵 25 点，杀 260 名即可到中立。但你升级时完成的每个 {area:35} 任务，都会扣除相当于其 {area:35} 声望奖励五倍的血帆声望（“你自己的OOX”“荆棘谷热疫”和“挑战奈古拉什”各扣 1,000 点），每杀一名血帆海盗还会再扣 25 点；做过 {area:35} 的任务后，声望可能已接近仇恨最底端，到中立最多要杀 1,680 名卫兵。计算方法：声望条距敌对还差的点数，加上 6,000，再除以 25。卫兵（57 级）攻击很重，会撒网和击退；地精呼救时还会跑来新的卫兵。在从隧道向左转、通往铁匠房屋的小路上打：两名卫兵在这里巡逻，很少碰头。它们死后，走进房子（或攻击里面的一名地精），就会有新的卫兵跑来。玩家一般每小时能杀 30 至 40 名。如果 {area:35} 从中立 500 点开始，大约杀 53 名卫兵后就会变成仇恨。新年庆典期间，镇上的地精喝醉了，不会还手。{zone:1417} 的 {area:327} 有黑水船员（37-40 级），更容易杀，但每名只有 5 点声望。不要杀血帆海盗：每名会扣 25 点。",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 more: 120 Bruisers. Friendly is the last standing that unlocks anything."] = "中立到友善还需3,000点：击杀120名恶棍。友善是最后一个会解锁内容的声望等级。",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["The pirate outfit and the {item:10030}, bought with a war against {area:35} and every goblin town."] = "海盗服装和{item:10030}，代价是与{area:35}及所有地精城镇开战。",
	["The way back"] = "恢复声望的办法",
	["The {item:10030}"] = "{item:10030}",
	["the path to the smithy"] = "通往铁匠铺的小路",
	["{npc:14637}: Zapped Giants, open to the Hated"] = "{npc:14637}：被缩小的巨人，仇恨状态也能接受。",
	["{npc:2496} and {npc:2487} stand on the top floor of the {area:35} inn, out on the balcony. Both are level 60 and Bruisers come to their aid: clear the stairs first and pull them one at a time. They come back, so a friend can kill them too."] = "{npc:2496} 和 {npc:2487} 站在 {area:35} 旅店顶层的外侧阳台上。两人都是60级，而且地精卫兵会来支援：先清理楼梯，再逐个引出。他们会刷新，因此朋友也能完成击杀。",
	["{npc:2546}, on the {area:1757}: 25"] = "{npc:2546}，位于{area:1757}：25",
	["{npc:2546}: the {item:22746}"] = "{npc:2546}：{item:22746}",
	["{npc:4624}: +25"] = "{npc:4624}：+25",
}

G["forever/reputation/brood-of-nozdormu"] = {
	["10"] = "10",
	["10 (and 100 Cenarion Circle)"] = "10 点声望（另有 100 点塞纳里奥议会声望）",
	["100"] = "100",
	["100 (and 100 Cenarion Circle)"] = "100 点声望（另有 100 点塞纳里奥议会声望）。",
	["200"] = "200",
	["200 (and 200 Cenarion Circle)"] = "200 点声望（另有 200 点塞纳里奥议会声望）",
	["500"] = "500",
	["75"] = "75",
	["A raid event: follow {npc:11832} toward {area:2361} and keep him alive against Eranikus and his nightmare adds until Tyrande arrives and redeems Eranikus. Do not kill Eranikus."] = "团队事件：跟随 {npc:11832} 前往 {area:2361}，在伊兰尼库斯及其梦魇随从的攻击下保护他存活，直到泰兰德到来并救赎伊兰尼库斯。不要杀死伊兰尼库斯。",
	["After The Path, Baristolth takes 200 more fragments for {quest:8302}: 200 reputation, again and again, but only until Neutral. From Hated 500 that is 208 turn-ins, 41,600 fragments, 20,000 to 30,000 elite kills: the only way without the Temple, and a very long one. With the {area:16076} open (a 40-player raid) it is far quicker: every Temple trash mob gives 100 until 2,999 of 3,000 Neutral, about 9,500 a full clear, so four to five clears reach Neutral. Save every {item:21230} and {item:21229} you loot until the trash stops counting: they pay the same later."] = "完成 正义之路 后，流沙守望者巴里斯托尔斯会再收200块碎片来完成 {quest:8302}：每次200声望，可反复交还，但只能到中立。从仇恨500开始，需要交还208次、41,600块碎片，约击杀20,000至30,000只精英：这是不打神殿的唯一方式，而且非常漫长。{area:16076} 开放后（40人团队副本）会快得多：神殿每只小怪提供100声望，直到中立2,999/3,000为止，完整清理一次约得9,500，因此四到五次即可达到中立。在小怪不再提供声望之前，保留所有拾取到的 {item:21230} 和 {item:21229}：以后交还的收益相同。",
	["At Exalted, {npc:15192} gives the last ring of your path: The Protector of Kalimdor, The Qiraji Conqueror or The Grand Invoker. Bring the Revered ring; 100 reputation."] = "崇拜时，{npc:15192} 会给予所选路线的最后一枚戒指：卡利姆多的保护者、其拉虫人的征服者或虔诚的祈求者。带上崇敬时的戒指；奖励100点声望。",
	["At Friendly, {npc:15192} upgrades the ring of the path you chose: The Path of the Protector, Conqueror or Invoker. Bring the ring you wear; 100 reputation."] = "达到友善后，{npc:15192} 会升级你所选路线的戒指：“保护者之路”、征服者之路或祈求者之路。带上你佩戴的戒指；奖励 100 点声望。",
	["At Honored, {npc:15192} upgrades the ring of the path you chose: The Path of the Protector, Conqueror or Invoker. Bring the ring you wear; 100 reputation."] = "尊敬时，{npc:15192} 会升级你所选路线的戒指：保护者之路、征服者之路或祈求者之路。带上正在佩戴的戒指；奖励100点声望。",
	["At Revered, {npc:15192} upgrades the ring of the path you chose: The Path of the Protector, Conqueror or Invoker. Bring the ring you wear; 100 reputation."] = "达到崇敬后，{npc:15192} 会升级你所选路线的戒指：“保护者之路”、征服者之路或祈求者之路。带上你佩戴的戒指；奖励 100 点声望。",
	["Back to Baristolth"] = "返回巴里斯托尔处。",
	["Back to {npc:11811}"] = "返回{npc:11811}处",
	["Baristolth in {area:3425}"] = "{area:3425} 的流沙守望者巴里斯托尔斯",
	["Brood of Nozdormu Reputation"] = "诺兹多姆的子嗣声望",
	["Friendly to Honored: the turn-ins"] = "友善到尊敬：交还收集品",
	["Hated to Neutral"] = "仇恨到中立",
	["Honored to Revered"] = "尊敬到崇敬",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000: twelve artifacts, 24 insignias, or a mix with {npc:15727} (2,500). After the first, each insignia is the repeatable {quest:8595}. Every Temple boss sometimes drops an {quest:8789} or Regalia (about one time in twenty): {npc:15380} and {npc:15378}, inside the Temple once {npc:15727} is dead, take it with 3 {item:18562} for 200 and a weapon. Honored opens the chest exchange of the tier set (200)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要 12,000 点：十二件神器、24 枚徽记，或混合交还并击杀 {npc:15727}（2,500 点）。首次之后，每枚徽记都通过可重复任务 {quest:8595} 交还。每名神殿首领都有概率掉落 {quest:8789} 或 其拉帝王徽记（约二十分之一）：{npc:15727} 死后，神殿内的 {npc:15380} 和 {npc:15378} 会收取它，再加 3 个 {item:18562}，奖励 200 点声望和一件武器。尊敬后开放套装胸甲兑换（200 点）。",
	["Meet {npc:15192}"] = "会见{npc:15192}",
	["Neutral opens the rest of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands chain. Baristolth sends you back to {quest:8303}."] = "中立后会开放流沙节杖任务链的剩余部分。巴里斯托尔斯会让你返回 {quest:8303}。",
	["Neutral to Friendly in the Temple"] = "在神殿内从中立提升到友善。",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 reputation. Every trash mob of the {area:16076} (a 40-player raid behind the {area:2737}) gives 100, and the Twin Emperors 210 each, until 2,999 of 3,000 Neutral, one point short of Friendly; there they stop. Then hand in one saved {item:21230} (1,000, to {npc:15502}) or {item:21229} (500, to {npc:15503}) to tip you over. The shoulder and boot exchanges of the Temple's tier set need no standing: the token, two idols and ten scarabs to {npc:15502} (shoulders) or {npc:15503} (boots) pay 200 each. The {area:3454} (20 players) give a little from bosses: Kurinnaxx, Moam, Buru and Ayamiss 50 each, Rajaxx 34, Ossirian 100, to Exalted."] = "中立到友善需要3,000声望。{area:16076}（{area:2737}后方的40人团队副本）的每只普通怪提供100，双子皇帝各提供210，直到中立进度2,999/3,000，距离友善差一点时停止。此时交还一个留存的{item:21230}（1,000，交给{npc:15502}）或{item:21229}（500，交给{npc:15503}），即可跨过门槛。神殿套装的肩部和鞋子兑换没有声望等级要求：将兑换物、2个雕像和10个圣甲虫交给{npc:15502}（肩部）或{npc:15503}（鞋子），每次奖励200。{area:3454}（20人）的首领提供少量声望：库林纳克斯、莫阿姆、布鲁和阿亚米斯各50，拉贾克斯34，奥斯里安100，可一直到崇拜。",
	["Now hand in what you saved. Each {item:21230} (any Temple trash, 1% to 9%) starts {quest:8784}: 1,000 reputation from {npc:15502}, one of the three bronze dragons inside the Temple. Each {item:21229} (nearly every Temple boss) goes to {npc:15503} for {quest:8595}: 500 here and 100 Cenarion Circle. {npc:15727} gives 2,500, to Exalted. Friendly to Honored is 6,000: six artifacts or twelve insignias. Friendly also opens the helm and leg exchanges of the Temple's tier set (200 reputation each) at {npc:15502} and {npc:15503}."] = "现在交还你攒下的物品。每个 {item:21230}（神殿任意小怪掉落，概率 1% 至 9%）都会开启 {quest:8784}：交给神殿内三条青铜龙之一的 {npc:15502}，可获 1,000 点声望。每个 {item:21229}（几乎每名神殿首领都会掉落）交给 {npc:15503} 完成 {quest:8595}：本阵营 500 点，另有塞纳里奥议会 100 点。{npc:15727} 会给予 2,500 点声望，直到崇拜都有效。友善到尊敬需要 6,000 点：六件神器或十二枚徽记。友善还会开放神殿套装的头盔和护腿兑换，在 {npc:15502} 和 {npc:15503} 处进行（每件 200 点声望）。",
	["Number Two"] = "第二项",
	["Pick one: The Path of the Protector, the Conqueror or the Invoker, 100"] = "三选一：保护者之路、征服者之路或祈求者之路，100点",
	["Reputation · Raids and dungeons"] = "声望 · 团队副本与地下城",
	["Revered to Exalted"] = "崇敬到崇拜",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 21 artifacts or 42 insignias, with {npc:15727}'s 2,500 a week. {npc:15727}'s eye starts {quest:8801} for {npc:15379} (200, and 200 Cenarion Circle). At Exalted Anachronos gives the last ring: The Protector of Kalimdor, The Qiraji Conqueror or The Grand Invoker."] = "从崇敬到崇拜需要21,000点：相当于21件神器或42枚徽记，另有 {npc:15727} 每周提供的2,500点。{npc:15727} 的眼睛会开启交给 {npc:15379} 的 {quest:8801}（200点，以及200点塞纳里奥议会声望）。崇拜后，阿纳克洛斯会给予最后一枚戒指：卡利姆多的保护者、其拉虫人的征服者或虔诚的祈求者。",
	["Stewvul's crate"] = "斯图沃尔的箱子",
	["The Bronze Dragonflight's ring, upgraded at every standing; a long climb from Hated, mostly in raids."] = "青铜龙军团的戒指，每提升一级声望即可升级；从仇恨开始的漫长攀升，主要靠团队副本。",
	["The Exalted ring"] = "崇拜戒指",
	["The Redemption of Eranikus: raid"] = "伊兰尼库斯的救赎：团队",
	["The blue shard: Azuregos's ledger"] = "蓝色碎片：艾索雷葛斯的账本",
	["The four dream portals sit in groves guarded by elite dragonkin of level 60 to 62 that respawn every 30 minutes; each drops the portal's fragment one time in twenty. Raid content."] = "四座翡翠梦境传送门位于林地中，由60至62级精英龙类守卫，每30分钟刷新；每只掉落对应传送门碎片的概率为二十分之一。这是团队内容。",
	["The green shard: Eranikus"] = "绿色碎片：伊兰尼库斯",
	["The island off {area:987}"] = "{area:987}外海的小岛",
	["The red shard: Vaelastrasz"] = "红色碎片：堕落的瓦拉斯塔兹",
	["The red shard: {npc:13020}, the second boss of {area:2677}, gives {quest:8730} before his fight; Nefarian, the last boss, drops the {item:21138} for one raider on the quest each kill. The quest lasts five hours."] = "红色碎片：{area:2677} 的第二名首领 {npc:13020} 会在战斗前给予 {quest:8730}；最终首领奈法利安每次击杀会为一名接了任务的团队成员掉落 {item:21138}。任务限时五小时。",
	["The ring at Friendly"] = "友善时的戒指",
	["The ring at Honored"] = "尊敬时的戒指",
	["The ring at Revered"] = "崇敬时的戒指",
	["The {area:1121}"] = "{area:1121}",
	["The {faction:910} is not in your reputation list until you meet {npc:15192}. {npc:15180}, in the main building of {area:3425}, sends you to him. Meeting him sets you at Hated, 0 of 36,000: Neutral is 42,000 reputation away, and almost all of it comes from raids. {area:2677} and the {area:16076} are not among the first raids Blizzard has announced for Forever: until one of them opens, the 100 from Baristolth's first quest is all the Brood reputation there is. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain; the numbers in this guide are without it."] = "见到{npc:15192}之前，声望列表中不会出现{faction:910}。{area:3425}主建筑内的{npc:15180}会派你去找他。见面后声望设为仇恨0/36,000：距离中立还差42,000声望，几乎都要通过团队副本获得。{area:2677}和{area:16076}不在暴雪已公布的无限服首批团队副本之列：在其中一个开放前，流沙守望者巴里斯托尔斯第一个任务奖励的100点就是全部可获取的龙族声望。传承的外交家特长使每次声望获取最多增加10%；本指南数字均未计入此加成。",
	["The {npc:15481} stands on the south coast of {zone:1447}. His ledger starts {npc:11811}'s long chain in {zone:1446}."] = "{npc:15481} 站在 {zone:1447} 南部海岸。他的账本会开启 {zone:1446} 的 {npc:11811} 提供的漫长任务链。",
	["The {npc:15624}"] = "{npc:15624}",
	["The {npc:15625} (level 63 boss) always drops its fragment."] = "{npc:15625}（63级首领）必定掉落其碎片。",
	["The {object:180633}"] = "{object:180633}",
	["The {object:180633} is a small red crystal on the ground just outside the gates of {area:3428}, in the far south-west of {zone:1451}. Click it, then stay and watch the vision of the War of the Shifting Sands to its end. If it is cut short, abandon the quest and click the Tear again."] = "{object:180633} 是 {zone:1451} 西南尽头、{area:3428} 大门外地面上的一块小红色水晶。点击后留在原地，将流沙之战的幻象看完。如果幻象中断，放弃任务，再次点击这滴泪。",
	["The {object:180642} leans on the {area:230} at the south end of {zone:1421}, left of the closed gate."] = "{object:180642} 斜靠在 {zone:1421} 最南端的 {area:230} 上，位于紧闭大门左侧。",
	["The {object:180652} lies on the farther of two islands south of {area:987}, past the fatigue line. {npc:15526}, on the sea floor south of the beach's crashed gyrocopter, gives {quest:8599} and a three-minute swim-speed blessing that gets you across."] = "{object:180652} 位于 {area:987} 南侧两座岛屿中较远的那一座，在疲劳线之外。{npc:15526} 位于海滩坠毁旋翼机南侧的海底，会给予 {quest:8599} 和持续三分钟的游泳速度祝福，让你能游过去。",
	["The {zone:1431} portal"] = "{zone:1431} 的传送门",
	["The {zone:1440} portal"] = "{zone:1440} 的传送门",
	["The {zone:1444} portal"] = "{zone:1444} 的传送门",
	["Watch the vision"] = "观看幻象。",
	["With the three shards, {npc:15192} makes the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. In Classic its first holder rings the {object:180717} once for the whole realm, opening the gates of {area:3428}, and those who finish within ten hours earn the black qiraji crystal mount; whether Forever's realms get that event is not known."] = "集齐三块碎片后，{npc:15192} 会制作流沙节杖。经典旧世中，第一位持有者可为整个服务器敲响一次 {object:180717}，开启 {area:3428} 大门；在十小时内完成的玩家可获得黑色其拉水晶坐骑；目前尚不清楚无限的服务器是否会开放这一事件。",
	["{area:2677} is a 40-player raid at the top of {area:254}. {npc:12017} always drops his head."] = "{area:2677} 是位于 {area:254} 顶部的 40 人团队副本。{npc:12017} 必定掉落头颅。",
	["{item:12360}: Alchemists, or the auction house"] = "{item:12360}：找炼金师，或去拍卖行购买",
	["{item:18562}, {area:2677} or the auction house"] = "{item:18562}，来自 {area:2677} 或拍卖行",
	["{item:18562}: {area:2677}, or the auction house"] = "{item:18562}：{area:2677}，或拍卖行",
	["{item:20383}: raid of 40"] = "{item:20383}：40人团队",
	["{item:21027}, {npc:12803}: raid"] = "{item:21027}，{npc:12803}：需要团队。",
	["{item:21137}, {npc:15571}: raid"] = "{item:21137}，{npc:15571}：需要团队。",
	["{item:21137}: 200"] = "{item:21137}：200",
	["{item:21138}, Nefarian"] = "{item:21138}，奈法利安。",
	["{item:21138}: 200"] = "{item:21138}：200",
	["{item:21139}: 100"] = "{item:21139}：100",
	["{item:21175} quest chain"] = "{item:21175}任务线",
	["{item:21229}, Temple bosses"] = "{item:21229}，由神殿首领掉落",
	["{item:21230}: right-click it, then {npc:15502}"] = "{item:21230}：右键点击，然后找{npc:15502}",
	["{npc:11811}, a goblin seer, lives in a hut north-east of {area:976}. He sends you three ways at once: to Stewvul's crate in {zone:1421}, to an island off the south coast of {zone:1446}, and to {npc:8125} in {area:976}."] = "{npc:11811} 是一位地精先知，住在 {area:976} 东北面的小屋里。他会同时派你去三个地方：{zone:1421} 的斯图沃尔箱子、{zone:1446} 南部近海的一座岛屿，以及 {area:976} 的 {npc:8125}。",
	["{npc:11811}: 200"] = "{npc:11811}：200",
	["{npc:11811}: 25"] = "{npc:11811}：25",
	["{npc:12803} and the Chimaerok on the {area:1121} are elites of level 60 to 62 that respawn every ten minutes: a raid's work. The Chimaerok drop a tenderloin about half the time, Lakmaeran two to four now and then."] = "{npc:12803} 和 {area:1121} 的奇美洛克都是60至62级精英，每十分钟刷新，需要团队应对。奇美洛克约有一半概率掉落一块里脊肉，拉克麦拉偶尔会掉落两至四块。",
	["{npc:13020}, {area:2677}: raid of 40"] = "{npc:13020}，{area:2677}：40 人团队",
	["{npc:15192} at the {area:2300}"] = "{area:2300}的{npc:15192}",
	["{npc:15192} now offers the {item:21200} in three kinds: the Path of the Protector (tanks), of the Conqueror (melee fighters) or of the Invoker (casters). Take one: the other two close. Each standing from Friendly to Exalted brings an upgrade of the same ring, 100 reputation each. {quest:8555} sends you after the three shards of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands."] = "{npc:15192}现在提供三种{item:21200}：保护者之路（坦克）、征服者之路（近战）或祈求者之路（施法者）。选一种，另外两种就会关闭。从友善到崇拜，每提升一个声望等级就能升级同一枚戒指，每次奖励100声望。{quest:8555}会让你寻找流沙节杖的3块碎片。",
	["{npc:15192}, a bronze dragon in elf form, stands at the mouth of the {area:2300} in eastern {zone:1446}, south-east of {area:976}. Walk up to him."] = "{npc:15192} 是一条化身精灵的青铜龙，站在 {zone:1446} 东部的 {area:2300} 入口，位于 {area:976} 东南方。走近他。",
	["{npc:15192}: the Exalted ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你所选路线的崇拜戒指任务。",
	["{npc:15192}: the Friendly ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你所选路线的友善戒指任务",
	["{npc:15192}: the Honored ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你所选路线的尊敬戒指任务",
	["{npc:15192}: the Revered ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你所选路线的崇敬戒指任务",
	["{npc:15362} appears beside the {npc:5709} at the bottom of the {area:1477} (a five-player dungeon). He sends you to a {npc:15624} outside {zone:1457} (Horde players walk past the city's guards), then to {npc:11832} in {zone:1450}."] = "{npc:15362} 出现在 {area:1477}（五人地下城）底部的 {npc:5709} 旁。他会让你去找 {zone:1457} 外的一名 {npc:15624}（部落玩家需从城市守卫旁走过），再去找 {zone:1450} 的 {npc:11832}。",
	["{npc:15362}, inside the {area:1477}"] = "{npc:15362}，位于{area:1477}内",
	["{npc:15378}: Regalia and 3 {item:18562}, 200"] = "{npc:15378}：其拉帝王徽记 和 3 个 {item:18562}，200 点声望。",
	["{npc:15379}: 200"] = "{npc:15379}：200",
	["{npc:15380}: Armaments and 3 {item:18562}, 200"] = "{npc:15380}：其拉帝王武器 和 3 个 {item:18562}，200 点声望。",
	["{npc:15502}: 1,000"] = "{npc:15502}：1,000",
	["{npc:15554}, elite: group of 3 to 5"] = "{npc:15554}，精英：3 至 5 人小队",
	["{npc:15624}: 25 (and 25 Cenarion Circle)"] = "{npc:15624}：25声望（另有25点塞纳里奥议会声望）",
	["{npc:8125} cooks in {area:976}. He sends you to the {area:1121} off southern {zone:1444} for a Chimaerok feast."] = "{npc:8125} 在 {area:976} 做饭。他会派你前往 {zone:1444} 南部近海的 {area:1121}，筹备奇美洛克盛宴。",
	["{npc:8125} wants 20 {item:9061} and 20 {item:8150} with the meat. {npc:11811} then wants 20 Arcanite Bars, 10 {item:18562}, 10 Azerothian Diamonds and 10 Blue Sapphires, and gives you an {item:21136}: placed at the {object:180669} in {zone:1447}'s {area:1227}, it calls up {npc:15571}, a level 63 boss for a raid. {npc:15571} drops the {item:21137} for one raider on the quest each kill."] = "{npc:8125} 要求在肉之外再交20份 {item:9061} 和20份 {item:8150}。随后 {npc:11811} 需要20块奥金锭、10份 {item:18562}、10颗艾泽拉斯钻石和10颗蓝宝石，并给你一个 {item:21136}：放在 {zone:1447} 的 {area:1227} 内的 {object:180669} 处，可召出63级团队首领 {npc:15571}。每次击杀 {npc:15571}，只会为一名接有任务的团队成员掉落 {item:21137}。",
	["{npc:8125}'s Chops"] = "{npc:8125} 的肉排",
	["{object:180633}: 50"] = "{object:180633}：50",
	["{object:180642}: 10"] = "{object:180642}：10",
	["{object:180652}: 10"] = "{object:180652}：10",
	["{object:180717} hangs before the gates of {area:3428}. {npc:15693} appears beside it once the gong has been rung, with {quest:8745}: a weapon and 200 reputation."] = "{object:180717} 悬挂在 {area:3428} 大门前。有人敲响甲虫之锣后，{npc:15693} 会出现在旁边，提供 {quest:8745}：奖励一件武器和200点声望。",
	["{quest:8288} wants the head of {npc:12017}, the third boss of {area:2677} (a 40-player raid in {area:254}). Everything after it needs the head, the fragment turn-ins included: until you have it, {quest:8286} is all the Brood reputation there is, solo or not."] = "{quest:8288} 需要 {npc:12017} 的头颅，他是 {area:2677} 的第三名首领（位于 {area:254} 的 40 人团队副本）。之后所有内容都需要先取得头颅，包括交还碎片：拿到之前，无论是否独自游玩，都只能靠 {quest:8286} 获取青铜龙声望。",
	["{quest:8301} wants 200 Silithid Carapace Fragments. Every hive silithid drops one to three on most kills: the Hive'Ashi Workers, Stingers, Swarmers and Defenders north and north-west of {area:3425}, and those of {area:2743} in the west and {area:2744} in the south. Almost all of them are elites of level 57 to 60: one at a time solo, faster in a group."] = "{quest:8301} 需要 200 个异种蝎壳碎片。虫巢中的所有异种虫，大多数击杀都会掉落一至三个：包括 {area:3425} 北侧和西北侧的亚什工蝎、毒蝎、群居蝎与防御者，以及西侧 {area:2743} 和南侧 {area:2744} 的异种虫。它们几乎全是 57 至 60 级精英：单人要逐个击杀，组队则更快。",
	["{quest:8302}: 200 fragments, 200"] = "{quest:8302}：200 个碎片，200 点声望",
	["{quest:8303}'s quests"] = "{quest:8303}的任务",
	["{quest:8303}: 200"] = "{quest:8303}：200",
	["{quest:8595}: 1 insignia, 500"] = "{quest:8595}：1枚徽记，500",
	["{quest:8597}, Volume II"] = "{quest:8597}，第二卷",
	["{quest:8597}: Volume II"] = "{quest:8597}：第二卷",
	["{quest:8606} sends you, disguised with {npc:11811}'s turban, to a drop-off point south of {area:2255} in {zone:1452}. Leave the bag of gold there: {npc:15554}, a level 61 elite, comes for it (group of 3 to 5)."] = "{quest:8606}会让你戴上{npc:11811}的头巾伪装，前往{zone:1452}的{area:2255}南面交接点。将金币袋留在那里：61级精英{npc:15554}会来取（建议3-5人小队）。",
	["{quest:8620} needs the eight chapters of {quest:8597}, Volume II: from {npc:15552} in his house on {area:2079} (a level 63 elite with guards, raid), the Felguard Elites, Doomguard Commanders and Dreadlords of the {zone:1419}, the Hederine south of {area:2255}, and a book in the {zone:1458}. {npc:11811} hands out the binding when you accept."] = "{quest:8620} 需要 {quest:8597} 第二卷的八个章节：来源包括 {npc:15552} 在 {area:2079} 的房屋（他是 63 级精英，带守卫，需要团队）、{zone:1419} 的地狱卫士精英、末日守卫指挥官和恐惧魔王、{area:2255} 南边的赫达琳恶魔，以及 {zone:1458} 的一本书。接任务时，{npc:11811} 会给你装订用的书壳。",
	["{quest:8735} wants a fragment from each of the four Dragons of Nightmare portals: elite dragonkin at the {zone:1440}, {zone:1444} and {zone:1425} portals (5% each) and the {npc:15625} in {zone:1431}. Raid content."] = "{quest:8735} 需要从四座梦魇之龙传送门各获得一块碎片：{zone:1440}、{zone:1444} 和 {zone:1425} 传送门处的精英龙人（各5%），以及 {zone:1431} 的 {npc:15625}。这是团队内容。",
	["{zone:1425} portal"] = "{zone:1425}传送门",
}

G["forever/reputation/cenarion-circle"] = {
	["10 texts: 100"] = "10 份密文：100 点声望。",
	["100"] = "100",
	["3 crests and a {item:14344}: the Medallion of Station"] = "3个纹章和1个{item:14344}：身份勋章",
	["3 signets and 5 Large Brilliant Shards: the Ring of Lordship"] = "3枚徽记和5块大块魔光碎片：暮光贵族之戒",
	["3 {quest:8362}: 50"] = "3个{quest:8362}：50",
	["3 {quest:8363}: 100, Honored"] = "3个{quest:8363}：100，尊敬",
	["3 {quest:8364}: 150, Revered"] = "3个 {quest:8364}：150，崇敬",
	["A 20-player raid behind the {area:2737} in the far south-west of {zone:1451}. A full clear is about 1,600 Cenarion reputation: the trash 3 each until 20,999 of 21,000 Revered, Kurinnaxx, Moam, Buru and Ayamiss 150 each and Ossirian 300, to Exalted. Ossirian's head starts {quest:8791} (200 here and 200 {npc:15185}). Their drops buy the ring (Honored), cloak (Revered) and weapon (Exalted) quests of {npc:15498}, {npc:15500} and {npc:15499} in the Hold, 100 reputation each. {npc:16091} in the Hold pays 100 once for {quest:9023}: {item:22217} from here and Venoxis's from {area:19}. {npc:15471} sells {item:22219} (Revered, 5g) and {item:22191} (Exalted, 8g) inside."] = "这是位于 {zone:1451} 最西南端 {area:2737} 后方的20人团队副本。完整通关一次约获得1,600塞纳里奥声望：小怪每只3点，直到崇敬20,999/21,000；库林纳克斯、莫阿姆、布鲁和阿亚米斯各150点，奥斯里安300点，首领声望可到崇拜。奥斯里安的头颅触发 {quest:8791}（此处200点，另有200点 {npc:15185}）。他们的掉落可用于要塞内 {npc:15498}、{npc:15500} 和 {npc:15499} 的戒指（尊敬）、披风（崇敬）和武器（崇拜）任务，每个任务100声望。要塞内的 {npc:16091} 为一次性的 {quest:9023} 奖励100声望：需要这里的 {item:22217} 和 {area:19} 的高阶祭司温诺希斯对应物品。副本内 {npc:15471} 出售 {item:22219}（崇敬，5金币）和 {item:22191}（崇拜，8金币）。",
	["Allegiance: one Combat, Logistics and Tactical badge, 200"] = "塞纳里奥议会的盟友：作战、后勤和战术徽章各一枚，200 点声望",
	["Around {area:3425}"] = "{area:3425}周围",
	["Back at the Hold"] = "返回要塞",
	["Back to Ortell"] = "返回隐士奥泰尔处",
	["Back to {area:3425}"] = "回到{area:3425}",
	["Back to {area:3425} with news"] = "带着消息返回{area:3425}",
	["Bronzebeard's Encampment"] = "铜须营地",
	["Cenarion Circle Reputation"] = "塞纳里奥议会声望",
	["Cultists until the top of Friendly, texts saved"] = "击杀教徒到友善满，保留暮光密文信",
	["Do the {zone:1422} and {area:2100} quests while you level; at 60 they may pay a fraction."] = "升级时就完成 {zone:1422} 和 {area:2100} 的任务；到了 60 级，声望奖励可能只剩一小部分。",
	["Dredge Crusher"] = "挖掘粉碎者",
	["Dredge Striker"] = "挖掘打击者",
	["Each Keeper is a level 60, not elite, alone at a camp edge, and always drops its chapter: Mayna in the far west camp, Havunth in the camp south-west of the Hold, Exeter in the far south-west camp beside the Twilight Lord."] = "每名守护者都是 60 级非精英，独自待在营地边缘，必定掉落对应章节：玛恩在最西侧营地，哈弗斯在要塞西南方的营地，埃克斯特在西南尽头的营地、暮光领主旁边。",
	["Forever's new {zone:1451} patterns for Tailors, Leatherworkers and Blacksmiths, Friendly and Honored"] = "无限为裁缝、制皮和锻造新增的{zone:1451}图样，友善和尊敬",
	["Friendly (3,000) opens Kania's {item:20732} (10g), Mishta's {item:22251} (2g) and {item:22758} (5g), and Forever's new Friendly gloves patterns (7g 50s)."] = "友善（3,000）后可购买卡妮亚的 {item:20732}（10 金币）、米什塔的 {item:22251}（2 金币）和 {item:22758}（5 金币），以及无限新增的友善手套图样（7 金 50 银）。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation. {npc:15306} takes 10 {quest:8319} for 100 reputation, again and again, until Exalted: 120 turn-ins (1,200 texts) to Revered without the quests, or about 950 texts after them. Hand in the texts you saved now. The cultists no longer count, but the Flamereavers, Twilight Keepers, Marauders and Templars count until 11,999 of 12,000 Honored, and the {npc:14479} and Prophet until Exalted. Honored opens Kania's {item:20733} (10g), Mishta's {item:22773} (5g) and Forever's new Honored patterns (7g 50s each)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要 12,000 点声望。{npc:15306} 会反复收取 10 份 {quest:8319}，每次给予 100 点声望，直到崇拜：不算任务，到崇敬需要交还 120 次（1,200 份密文）；做完任务后则约需 950 份。现在交还攒下的密文。击杀教徒已不再给予声望，但烈焰掠夺者、暮光守护者、掠夺者和圣殿骑士能给到尊敬 12,000 点中的 11,999 点，{npc:14479} 和预言者则能给到崇拜。尊敬后可购买卡妮亚的 {item:20733}（10 金币）、米什塔的 {item:22773}（5 金币），以及无限新增的尊敬图样（每张 7 金 50 银）。",
	["Kills alone to the top of Friendly is 8,999 kills (6,999 for druids), but the texts they drop (about 3,000) are worth 30,000 more: most of the way to Exalted."] = "仅靠击杀到友善满需要杀 8,999 只（德鲁伊 6,999 只），但掉落的暮光密文（约 3,000 份）还能换取 30,000 点声望：足够完成到崇拜的大部分进度。",
	["Larksbane"] = "拉克斯班",
	["Mistress Natalia"] = "纳塔莉亚·玛尔利斯",
	["Mistress Natalia Mar'alith"] = "纳塔莉亚·玛拉利斯女士",
	["Mistress Natalia: group of 3 to 5"] = "纳塔莉亚女王：三到五人小队",
	["Natalia, elite: group up"] = "纳塔莉亚，精英：请组队",
	["Nature resistance enchants and patterns, badge gear and Forever's new {zone:1451} patterns, from {zone:1451}'s camps."] = "自然抗性附魔和图样、徽章装备以及无限新增的{zone:1451}图样，来自{zone:1451}的营地。",
	["Neutral to Honored is 9,000 reputation (7,000 for druids). Every {npc:11880}, Geolord, Stonecaller, Master and Overlord gives 1 reputation until 5,999 of 6,000 Friendly, one point short of Honored; there they stop. Save every {item:20404} and leave the quests of the next steps for later: each kill below that point is a free point on top of its text, and the texts and quests pay the same at any standing. A text drops about every third kill, so 30 kills make 30 reputation and 10 texts (100 reputation later). Four camps: south-west of the Hold (39,44), the far west (26,34), the far south-west (19,84) and the north-east below {area:2742} (66,18: Overlords, and Flamereavers that count until the top of Honored). The {npc:15308} (87% text) walks between 18,31 and 23,69. Texts sell on the auction house if you would rather buy. At 5,999 Friendly the last point into Honored comes from a Flamereaver, Twilight Keeper or Marauder, or from your first 10 texts at {npc:15306}."] = "中立到尊敬需要9,000声望（德鲁伊为7,000）。每个{npc:11880}、地领主、唤石者、宗主和霸主都提供1点声望，直到友善5,999/6,000、距离尊敬还差一点时停止。留着每个{item:20404}，并把后面几步的任务留到以后：在这个界限前，每次击杀的声望都是文书之外白赚的一点，而交文书和做任务在任何声望阶段奖励相同。文书约每三只掉一本，因此击杀30只可获得30声望和10本文书（之后可换100声望）。有四处营地：要塞西南（39,44）、最西方（26,34）、最西南方（19,84），以及东北方{area:2742}下方（66,18：有霸主，还有击杀声望可持续到尊敬末尾的烈焰掠夺者）。{npc:15308}（文书掉率87%）在18,31与23,69之间走动。不想刷也可从拍卖行买文书。友善5,999时，升入尊敬的最后一点可通过击杀烈焰掠夺者、暮光守护者或掠夺者获得，也可向{npc:15306}交还第一批10本文书。",
	["Now cash in the one-time quests: about 1,700 reputation alone, 2,400 with the group quests. They are level 55 to 60, so they pay in full at 60. {quest:8280} needs {quest:8275} first. {npc:15196} is an elite scorpid with two guards (group of 2 or 3). {npc:15174}'s {quest:8307} is for Cooks: its recipe makes the {item:20452} he wants. {npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "现在去完成一次性任务：单人任务约1,700声望，加上小队任务共2,400。这些任务为55到60级，所以60级时能拿到全额声望。{quest:8280}需要先完成{quest:8275}。{npc:15196}是一只精英蝎子，带两个护卫（需2到3人小队）。{npc:15174}的{quest:8307}是给烹饪者的：其配方可做出他要的{item:20452}。{npc:15189}站在他所在建筑的楼上：从室内上楼，箭头无法区分楼层。",
	["Optional, 100 reputation once: {quest:9419}. Your side's camp sits by a hive: {npc:17080}'s by {area:2743} (Alliance), {npc:17079}'s by {area:2744} (Horde). Silithyst rises from glowing geysers around the desert: walk through one, carry the Silithyst to your camp's Silithyst Extractor, then talk to the camp's leader. It is a world PvP objective: players of the other side can take it from you."] = "可选，一次性奖励 100 点声望：{quest:9419}。本方营地位于虫巢旁：{npc:17080} 在 {area:2743} 旁（联盟），{npc:17079} 在 {area:2744} 旁（部落）。沙漠中发光的喷泉会喷出水晶尘：走进去，携带水晶尘回到本方营地的水晶尘提取器，再与营地首领交谈。这是世界 PvP 目标：敌对阵营玩家可以抢走你携带的水晶尘。",
	["Optional, and needed only for the Dredge quests later: {npc:15187} sends you to {zone:1451} with {quest:8275}, a 10-reputation letter. Skip it if you are already in {zone:1451}."] = "可选，仅后续掘泥虫任务需要：{npc:15187} 会给你 {quest:8275}，一封让你前往 {zone:1451} 的信，奖励 10 点声望。如果已经在 {zone:1451}，可以跳过。",
	["Optional, and needed only for the Dredge quests later: {npc:15188} sends you to {zone:1451} with {quest:8275}, a 10-reputation letter. Skip it if you are already in {zone:1451}."] = "可选，仅后续掘泥虫任务需要：{npc:15188} 会给你 {quest:8275}，一封让你前往 {zone:1451} 的信，奖励 10 点声望。如果已经在 {zone:1451}，可以跳过。",
	["Optional, for {quest:9023}: {npc:14507} is the first boss of {area:19}, a 20-player raid in north-east {zone:1434}."] = "可选，供{quest:9023}使用：{npc:14507}是{area:19}的第一个首领，该副本是位于{zone:1434}东北部的20人团队副本。",
	["Optional: Natalia waits deep in {area:2744}, the hive in the south of {zone:1451}. She is a level 62 elite who mind-controls, fears and heals herself below half health: bring a group of 3 to 5 and interrupt her heals."] = "可选：纳塔莉亚在 {area:2744} 深处等候，这是 {zone:1451} 南部的虫巢。她是 62 级精英，会精神控制、恐惧，并在生命值低于一半时治疗自己：带上 3 至 5 人小队，打断她的治疗。",
	["Optional: {quest:1123}'s chain pays 525 Cenarion reputation over seven quests of level 55 to 57, full at 60. {npc:10881} sends you to {npc:5769} on {area:1639}, who sends you to {quest:1123} in {area:2361}, {zone:1450}."] = "可选：{quest:1123} 任务线包含七个55到57级任务，共奖励525点塞纳里奥声望，60级仍可获得全额奖励。{npc:10881} 会派你找 {area:1639} 的 {npc:5769}，后者再让你去 {zone:1450} 的 {area:2361} 找 {quest:1123}。",
	["Optional: {quest:6762}'s chain pays 525 Cenarion reputation over seven quests of level 55 to 57, full at 60. {npc:10878} sends you to {npc:3516}, who sends you to {npc:4217}, who sends you to {quest:6762} in {area:2361}, {zone:1450}."] = "可选：{quest:6762}任务链包含7个55至57级任务，总计奖励525塞纳里奥声望，60级仍可全额获取。{npc:10878}让你找{npc:3516}，后者让你找{npc:4217}，再由其引导你前往{zone:1450}的{area:2361}做{quest:6762}。",
	["Quests elsewhere"] = "其他地方的任务",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation: 210 text turn-ins (2,100 texts), or less with the rest. From Honored, Bor takes 3 {quest:8363} for 100 (each Duke also gives 25, to Exalted), and {npc:15282} takes one {item:20515} for {quest:9248} (200, once). From Revered, {quest:8343} leads to {quest:8341}: 3 signets and 5 Large Brilliant Shards buy the Ring of Lordship, and set, medallion and ring open the {object:180466} for an Abyssal Lord: a level 63 boss for a raid of about 20, 50 reputation, and an {item:20515}. Bor pays 200 for the first scepter and 150 for each 3 after. Revered opens Mishta's {item:22252} (5g), {item:22660} (9g) and {item:22756} (5g); Exalted is the standing for Champion's Battlegear at {npc:15176}."] = "从崇敬到崇拜需要21,000点声望：相当于210次交还密文（2,100份密文），配合其他方式则更少。从尊敬起，鲍尔·蛮鬃每收取3个 {quest:8363} 奖励100点（每名公爵还提供25点，直到崇拜），{npc:15282} 则收取一个 {item:20515} 来完成 {quest:9248}（200点，仅一次）。从崇敬起，{quest:8343} 会引出 {quest:8341}：用3个徽记和5块大块魔光碎片换取统御之戒，穿齐套装并佩戴勋章和戒指，即可使用 {object:180466} 召唤深渊领主：63级首领，适合约20人的团队，击杀奖励50点声望和一个 {item:20515}。鲍尔·蛮鬃首次收取节杖奖励200点，之后每3根奖励150点。崇敬可向米什塔购买 {item:22252}（5金币）、{item:22660}（9金币）和 {item:22756}（5金币）；向 {npc:15176} 兑换“勇士的装备”则需要崇拜。",
	["Rubbings and brains"] = "拓印和大脑",
	["Rutgar and Frankal hand out the next two quests at their camp. Each hive has a {object:210337} to rub with the {item:20453}, and its silithid drop the brains: {area:2742} north of the Hold, {area:2743} in the west, {area:2744} in the south. Inside {area:2744} waits Mistress Natalia (level 62 elite, mind control and fear; group of 3 to 5). Now and then a hive silithid drops {quest:8308}: it starts a quest for Rutgar worth 100."] = "鲁特加尔·雕石和弗兰卡·石桥在营地里提供接下来的两个任务。每个虫巢都有一个 {object:210337}，需要用 {item:20453} 拓印，巢内异种蝎会掉落大脑：{area:2742} 在要塞北面，{area:2743} 在西面，{area:2744} 在南面。纳塔莉亚·玛尔利斯在 {area:2744} 内等候（62级精英，会精神控制和恐惧；需要三至五人小队）。虫巢异种蝎偶尔掉落 {quest:8308}：可触发交给鲁特加尔·雕石的任务，奖励100声望。",
	["Signets and scepters to Exalted"] = "用徽记和节杖提升到崇拜",
	["Silithyst"] = "水晶尘",
	["Stonelash Flayers, Pincers and Rock Stalkers live south and south-west of the Hold; their stingers and fangs drop about one time in ten. Dredge Crushers dig south and west of the Hold."] = "石鞭掠夺者、石鞭巨钳蝎和石行蜘蛛栖息在要塞南边及西南；毒刺和尖牙掉率约为十分之一。掘泥摧毁者在要塞南边和西边挖掘。",
	["Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers roam the sands around the Hold; Dredge Strikers dig north-east of it. The {object:180503} lies in the cultist camp south-west of the Hold."] = "石鞭蝎和掠沙蜘蛛在要塞周围的沙地游荡；掘泥打击者在东北面掘地。{object:180503}位于要塞西南面的教徒营地。",
	["Stonelash and Dredge Crushers"] = "石鞭系列敌人 与掘泥摧毁者",
	["Templars and the Abyssal Council"] = "圣殿骑士与深渊议会",
	["The Tortured Druids and Sentinels roam the ruins of {area:2738}, south-east of {area:3425}; the {object:178553} sits on the top floor of its wasp-circled tower."] = "被折磨的德鲁伊和哨兵在 {area:3425} 东南的 {area:2738} 遗迹内游荡；{object:178553} 位于一座有黄蜂盘旋的塔楼顶层。",
	["The broken camp in the far north-west of {zone:1451}: the Twilight Tablet Fragments lie on the ground among the ruins."] = "{zone:1451} 西北尽头的破败营地：暮光石板碎片散落在废墟间的地面上。",
	["The cultist camp west of {area:3425}"] = "{area:3425}西面的教徒营地",
	["The dwarves' camp in the south of {zone:1451}. Talk {npc:15171} and {npc:15170} through their whole stories for {quest:8304}. {item:20379} lies on the mountain south-east of the camp. {npc:15196} lives up the trail east of the camp: an elite, and his {spell:10101} can throw you off the cliff."] = "矮人营地在 {zone:1451} 南部。与 {npc:15171} 和 {npc:15170} 交谈，听完他们的全部故事，以完成 {quest:8304}。{item:20379} 位于营地东南面的山上。{npc:15196} 在营地东侧的小路上方：他是精英，他的 {spell:10101} 能把你打下悬崖。",
	["The emissary in {zone:1454}"] = "{zone:1454}的使者",
	["The emissary in {zone:1455}"] = "{zone:1455}的使者",
	["The nearest Twilight's Hammer camp lies just south-west of the Hold. Avengers, Geolords and Stonecallers (level 57 to 59) each drop an {item:20404} about a third of the time, and every cultist kill is 1 reputation. {npc:11804} walks the edge of the camp. Keep every cultist robe, cowl and mantle you loot: they are the Twilight Trappings for the Wind Stones later."] = "最近的暮光之锤营地就在要塞西南方不远。复仇者、地领主和召石者（57到59级）每只约有三分之一概率掉落一个 {item:20404}，每次击杀教徒还会获得1点声望。{npc:11804} 在营地边缘走动。拾取的教徒长袍、兜帽和披肩都要保留：它们就是之后使用风石所需的暮光套装。",
	["The three Twilight Keepers"] = "三名暮光守护者",
	["The {area:3100}"] = "{area:3100}",
	["The {area:3454}, when they open"] = "{area:3454}，开放后再去",
	["The {faction:609}'s other quests are spread over {zone:1414} and the Plaguelands. In Classic a quest pays less once it is 6 or more levels below you (a fifth less per level, down to a fifth): at 60, The Wildlife Suffers Too ({npc:10739}, {zone:1422}, levels 54 and 56) would pay 60 and 75 instead of 75 and 75, and Corruption of Earth and Seed ({area:2100}, level 51) 30 instead of 150. Your first turn-in shows which rule Forever uses. Shards of the Felvine ({quest:1123}, level 60, the {item:18501} from Alzzin in {area:2577}) pays 150 and its Reliquary 100 at any level."] = "{faction:609}的其他任务分布在{zone:1414}和瘟疫之地。在经典旧世，任务比玩家低6级或更多时奖励会减少（每级少五分之一，最低到五分之一）：60级时，《野生动物也受苦》（{npc:10739}，{zone:1422}，54和56级）只给60和75而不是75和75，而《大地与种子的腐化》（{area:2100}，51级）给30而不是150。你第一次交任务就能看出无限采用哪条规则。《魔藤碎片》（{quest:1123}，60级，{area:2577}中阿尔津掉的{item:18501}）在任何等级都给150，其后续的圣物匣任务给100。",
	["Tortured Druid"] = "受折磨的德鲁伊",
	["Tortured Sentinel"] = "受折磨的哨兵",
	["Twilight Avenger"] = "暮光复仇者",
	["Twilight Flamereaver"] = "暮光裂焰者",
	["Twilight Geolord"] = "暮光地质领主",
	["Twilight Overlord"] = "暮光霸主",
	["Twilight Stonecaller"] = "暮光唤石者",
	["Wanted poster: {npc:15196}, elite"] = "通缉告示：{npc:15196}，精英",
	["Wearing a full set of Twilight Trappings (cultist Cowl, Mantle and Robe, about 8%, 8% and 6% per cultist) lets you use a {object:180456}: two stand in each of the three western camps. A random Abyssal Templar appears: a level 60 elite for 1 to 3 players, 5 reputation until the top of Honored and an {item:20513} 93% of the time. The summon uses up the set (and later the medallion and ring too), and if the elemental gets away they are gone: summon only when you can win. {quest:8361} pays 100 for the first crest; after that Bor takes 3 crests for 50. From Friendly, {npc:15270} sends you to {quest:8331}: 3 crests and a {item:14344} buy the Medallion of Station that, worn with a set, opens the larger {object:180461} for a Duke (level 62 elite, group of 5; 25 reputation, {item:20514} 85%)."] = "穿齐暮光套装（教徒的兜帽、披肩和长袍，每个教徒的掉率分别约为8%、8%和6%）后，就能使用 {object:180456}：西边三个营地中每个都有两块。会随机出现一名深渊圣殿骑士：60级精英，适合一到三名玩家，击杀奖励5点声望，直到尊敬封顶，并有93%概率掉落一个 {item:20513}。召唤会消耗整套装备（之后还会消耗勋章和戒指），元素逃走后这些也无法找回：有把握获胜时再召唤。{quest:8361} 首次交还纹章奖励100点；之后鲍尔·蛮鬃每收取3个纹章奖励50点。从友善起，{npc:15270} 会指引你做 {quest:8331}：用3个纹章和一块 {item:14344} 换取身份勋章，佩戴它并穿齐套装即可使用更大的 {object:180461}，召唤公爵（62级精英，五人小队；25点声望，{item:20514} 掉率85%）。",
	["deliver Silithyst at the extractor"] = "在提取器处交还 水晶尘",
	["raid of 20"] = "20人团队",
	["{area:3425} is the walled druid camp in north-central {zone:1451}, with flight points for both sides. Everyone starts Neutral with the {faction:609} (druids at 2,000 of 3,000). Bor and {npc:15270} stand together in the main building. {quest:8318} opens the {item:20404} turn-ins for good. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain; the numbers in this guide are without it."] = "{area:3425} 是 {zone:1451} 中北部有围墙的德鲁伊营地，两个阵营都有飞行点。所有角色的 {faction:609} 初始声望都是中立（德鲁伊起始为 2,000/3,000）。鲍尔和 {npc:15270} 一起站在主建筑中。{quest:8318} 会永久解锁 {item:20404} 交还任务。传承特权外交家可让每次声望收益最多提高 10%；本指南中的数值均未计入此加成。",
	["{item:20385}, elite: group of 2 or 3"] = "{item:20385}，精英：两至三人小队",
	["{item:20404}: save them"] = "{item:20404}：留着",
	["{item:20452}, from the {object:180503}"] = "{item:20452}，来自{object:180503}",
	["{item:20452}, from {item:20424} and {item:3713}"] = "{item:20452}，由 {item:20424} 和 {item:3713} 制作",
	["{item:20456}, deep in {area:2744}"] = "{item:20456}，在{area:2744}深处",
	["{item:20465}, {npc:14862}: raid of 20"] = "{item:20465}、{npc:14862}：20人团队",
	["{item:20513}: Templar, group of 1 to 3"] = "{item:20513}：圣殿骑士，1 至 3 人小队。",
	["{item:20514}: Duke, group of 5"] = "{item:20514}：公爵，五人小队",
	["{item:20515}: Lord, raid of 20"] = "{item:20515}：领主，20人团队",
	["{item:22216}: raid of 20"] = "{item:22216}：20 人团队。",
	["{npc:11939} in {area:2361}"] = "{area:2361}的{npc:11939}",
	["{npc:15170}: 100"] = "{npc:15170}：100",
	["{npc:15171} and {npc:15170}"] = "{npc:15171}和{npc:15170}",
	["{npc:15174}, for Cooks"] = "{npc:15174}，适合厨师",
	["{npc:15189} and {npc:15190} stand upstairs in their building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15189}和{npc:15190}站在他们所在建筑的楼上：从室内上楼，箭头无法区分楼层。",
	["{npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15189}站在他所在建筑的楼上：从室内上楼，箭头无法区分楼层。",
	["{npc:15190} and Proudhorn"] = "{npc:15190} 和傲角。",
	["{npc:15190} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15190}站在他所在建筑的楼上：从室内上楼，箭头无法区分楼层。",
	["{npc:15191}, after {quest:8275}"] = "{npc:15191}，在 {quest:8275} 之后",
	["{npc:15194} hides in the hills of eastern {zone:1451}. He also decodes {quest:8319} for a chance at a scroll of beckoning, but {quest:8349} pays the reputation: keep the texts for Bor."] = "{npc:15194}藏在{zone:1451}东部的山丘中。他也能解读{quest:8319}，有机会得到召唤卷轴，但提供声望的是{quest:8349}：将暮光密文信留给鲍尔·蛮鬃。",
	["{npc:15201}: still counts at 5,999 Friendly"] = "{npc:15201}：友善5,999时仍可获得声望",
	["{npc:15270}, Friendly"] = "{npc:15270}，友善。",
	["{npc:15270}, Revered"] = "{npc:15270}，崇敬。",
	["{npc:15270}, level 60"] = "{npc:15270}，60级",
	["{npc:15306}: 10 texts, 100"] = "{npc:15306}：10 份密文，100 点声望。",
	["{npc:15306}: 10 texts, 100, for the last point"] = "{npc:15306}：10 份密文，100 点声望，补上最后一点",
	["{npc:15540} stands by the moonwell of {area:3425}. {quest:8507} (25 reputation, repeatable) sends you with unsigned papers to your side's captain: {npc:15440}'s Ironforge Brigade outside {area:2743} (Alliance) or {npc:15612}'s Orgrimmar Legion outside {area:2744} (Horde). Use the papers first, then talk to the captain: a level 60 elite silithid attacks; keep the captain alive and he signs. Kaldon then lets you pick a Combat, Logistics or {item:20809}, each holding a random briefing worth 50 reputation and a badge: 30 hive silithid kills (elites), goods such as 30 Heavy Runecloth Bandages or 3 {item:7936}, or one Templar, {npc:15542} or scout report. One badge of each kind buys {quest:9338} at Kaldon: 200 reputation, repeatable. A full round is about 375 reputation."] = "{npc:15540}站在{area:3425}的月亮井旁。{quest:8507}（25声望，可重复）让你带着未签字的文件去找本阵营队长：{area:2743}外{npc:15440}的铁炉堡旅（联盟），或{area:2744}外{npc:15612}的奥格瑞玛军团（部落）。先使用文件，再与队长交谈：会有一只60级精英异种虫攻击；保住队长，他就会签字。随后唤风者卡尔东让你从作战、后勤或{item:20809}中选择一种，每份随机简报奖励50声望及一枚徽章：可能要求击杀30只虫巢异种虫（精英），提供物资（例如30个厚符文布绷带或3个{item:7936}），或击杀一名圣殿骑士、{npc:15542}，或提交侦察报告。每种徽章各一枚可在唤风者卡尔东处完成{quest:9338}：200声望，可重复。完整一轮约375声望。",
	["{npc:16091}: 100"] = "{npc:16091}：100",
	["{quest:1123} lives in {area:2361}. She sends you to {npc:13220} at {area:3077}, the camp in the north-east corner of {zone:1451}."] = "{quest:1123} 住在 {area:2361}。她会派你去 {zone:1451} 东北角的营地 {area:3077} 找 {npc:13220}。",
	["{quest:8308}, a rare drop"] = "{quest:8308}，稀有掉落",
	["{quest:8314} leads to {quest:8315}: {npc:15183} sends you to the {area:3257} to summon {npc:14862}, a level 63 boss for a raid of about 20. Take it only with a raid."] = "{quest:8314} 会开启 {quest:8315}：{npc:15183} 让你去 {area:3257} 召唤 {npc:14862}，这是需要约 20 人团队挑战的 63 级首领。只有组织了团队才接。",
	["{quest:8319} to Revered"] = "{quest:8319}刷到崇敬",
	["{quest:8321} (level 61, not elite) waits at the back of {area:3446}, the cave in the north-east of {zone:1451}. Flamereavers and Twilight Masters guard the way: the Flamereavers count until the top of Honored, the Masters stop at the top of Friendly like the other cultists."] = "{quest:8321}（61级，非精英）位于 {zone:1451} 东北部洞穴 {area:3446} 的最深处。暮光烈焰掠夺者 和暮光主宰守着通路：暮光烈焰掠夺者 直到尊敬上限前都能提供声望，暮光主宰则与其他教徒一样，到友善上限就不再提供。",
	["{quest:8507}, level 60"] = "{quest:8507}，60级",
	["{quest:8800}: {npc:15176}'s badge gear"] = "{quest:8800}：{npc:15176} 的徽章兑换装备",
	["{zone:1451} quests at {area:3425}"] = "{area:3425}的{zone:1451}任务",
}

G["forever/reputation/centaur-clans"] = {
	["12 recipes for Carved Centaur Totems at the clan quartermasters, no standing needed"] = "部族军需官处可用{item:254432}兑换12种配方，无需声望",
	["At Honored, and after {quest:92743}, {npc:5398} sends you to {npc:253136} at the northern entrance of the {quest:92841}, in {zone:2652}. {npc:253136}'s quests (500 each: {quest:92844}, {quest:92846}, Corrupting Tears, Proof of Concept, No Mercy for the Weak, Bone Raising) and Hagiak's at the {area:16675} ({area:16677}, Long-Term Solutions, Threat of Starvation, Return to {npc:253136}) end with {npc:5601}: raise the dead khan with {npc:253136}'s staff at the tent by the lake in {area:604}, for 6,000, a title and a rare level 35 weapon. They all ask you to stay Honored or better. Honored to Revered is 12,000: the valley's quests pay about 11,000 of it, two {quest:92811} turn-ins the rest."] = "达到尊敬并完成{quest:92743}后，{npc:5398}会派你去找{zone:2652}的{quest:92841}北部入口处的{npc:253136}。{npc:253136}的任务（每个500声望：{quest:92844}、{quest:92846}、Corrupting Tears、Proof of Concept、No Mercy for the Weak、Bone Raising），以及{area:16675}的Hagiak提供的任务（{area:16677}、长远之计、断粮之危、返回{npc:253136}），最终都通向{npc:5601}：在{area:604}湖边帐篷旁，用{npc:253136}的法杖复活死去的可汗，获得6,000声望、一个头衔和一件35级精良武器。这些任务都要求保持尊敬或更高声望。尊敬到崇敬需要12,000：山谷任务约奖励11,000，其余通过交还两次{quest:92811}补足。",
	["At Honored, {npc:5397} sends you east to {npc:253177} at the southern entrance of the {quest:93034}, in {zone:2652}. {npc:253177}'s quests (500 each) take you among the undead and the outcasts there: {quest:93035}, {quest:93037} and {quest:93041}, then A Cleansing Cry from {npc:5397}, and a second line (Saving Our Own, Bone Burying, Checking Things Out) that ends with {npc:5601}: kill the Magram khan in his own village for 6,000, a title and a rare level 35 weapon. They all ask you to stay Honored or better. Honored to Revered is 12,000: the valley's quests pay about 10,600 of it, two or three {quest:92811} turn-ins the rest."] = "尊敬后，{npc:5397} 会让你向东，去 {zone:2652} 的 {quest:93034} 南入口找 {npc:253177}。{npc:253177} 的任务（每个 500 点）会让你深入当地亡灵和流放者之间：{quest:93035}、{quest:93037} 和 {quest:93041}，然后是 {npc:5397} 的 A Cleansing Cry，以及另一条任务线（Saving Our Own、Bone Burying、Checking Things Out），最后要对付 {npc:5601}：在玛格拉姆村内杀死他们的可汗，奖励 6,000 点声望、一个头衔和一件 35 级稀有武器。所有任务都要求保持尊敬或更高声望。尊敬到崇敬需要 12,000 点：山谷任务共奖励约 10,600 点，其余通过交还两三次 {quest:92811} 补足。",
	["Back to {npc:5397}, then east to the {zone:1435}: {quest:1373} (level 37) waits by a black cauldron in {area:76}, north-east of {area:75}."] = "回到{npc:5397}处，然后向东前往{zone:1435}：{quest:1373}（37级）在{area:75}东北方的{area:76}，一口黑色大锅旁等候。",
	["Both quartermasters sell the same 12 recipes for Carved Centaur Totems, no standing needed: {item:273613} and - Lesser Healing Power; Greater Spellblasting and {item:250941}; {item:250538} and {item:250606} plans; {item:252462}, {item:253973}, {item:10011} and {item:274490} patterns; the {item:269900} and {item:269902} schematics. Keep the totems you need for them before you hand the rest in."] = "两名军需官都出售相同的12种配方，用雕刻半人马图腾兑换，无声望等级要求：{item:273613}和 次级治疗强度；强效法术爆破 和{item:250941}；{item:250538}和{item:250606}图纸；{item:252462}、{item:253973}、{item:10011}和{item:274490}图样；以及{item:269900}和{item:269902}结构图。先留足兑换所需图腾，再交还其余的。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6,000; after the clan's quests you are about 3,000 into it (4,000 with {quest:1371}), so 2,000 to 3,000 to go. {npc:253139}'s {quest:92811} takes 5 Carved Centaur Totems for 750, again and again; the Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) of western {zone:1443} drop them, and the totems do not bind, so the auction house is the other source. Gelkis kills add 20 each, but Forever's kill data stops them at the end of Friendly, 1 short of Honored. At Friendly the village has two craft orders for 1,000 each: Mirda's 3 Greater Shadow Protection Potions and Grolkar's 2 Massive Iron Axes (blacksmithing). {npc:5398}'s {quest:92743} (1,000) is no craft order: he wants a {item:254392} from a crypt in the {zone:1418}, and Forever's quest pages put it in his chain before the {quest:92841}, so bring it before you reach Honored. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%."] = "友善到尊敬需要 6,000 点；完成部族任务后大约已有 3,000 点（做了 {quest:1371} 则有 4,000 点），还差 2,000 至 3,000 点。{npc:253139} 的 {quest:92811} 可反复交还，每次收取 5 个雕刻半人马图腾，奖励 750 点；图腾由 {zone:1443} 西部的玛洛迪半人马（36-40 级）掉落，不绑定，也可以从拍卖行购买。击杀吉尔吉斯每名增加 20 点，但无限的击杀数据表明，到友善末尾、差 1 点尊敬时就会停止。友善后村里有两个制造订单，每个奖励 1,000 点：Mirda 要 3 瓶强效暗影防护药水，Grolkar 要 2 把巨型铁斧（锻造）。{npc:5398} 的 {quest:92743}（1,000 点）不是制造订单：他需要 {zone:1418} 一处墓穴里的 {item:254392}，无限任务页面将它放在 {quest:92841} 之前的任务链中，所以尊敬前就带来。传承天赋“外交家”最多额外提高 10%。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6,000; after the clan's quests you are about 4,000 into it, so 2,000 to go. {npc:253140}'s {quest:92812} takes 5 Carved Centaur Totems for 750, again and again: three turn-ins, 15 totems. The Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) of western {zone:1443} drop them; the totems do not bind, so the auction house is the other source. Magram kills add 20 each, but Forever's kill data stops them at the end of Friendly, 1 short of Honored. At Friendly the village also has three craft orders for 1,000 each: Halea wants 3 Greater Mystic Essences, {npc:253140} a {item:10008} (tailoring) and Talra a {item:5739} (leatherworking). Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%."] = "友善到尊敬需要6,000；完成氏族任务后约已有4,000，还差2,000。{npc:253140}的{quest:92812}每次收取5个雕刻半人马图腾，奖励750声望，可反复交还：共需三次、15个图腾。{zone:1443}西部的玛洛迪半人马（36-40级）会掉落；图腾不绑定，因此也可从拍卖行购买。每杀一个玛格拉姆半人马增加20，但无限服的击杀数据将上限设在友善末尾，距尊敬还差1点。友善时，村里还会开放三项制作订单，每项奖励1,000：Halea需要3个强效秘法精华，{npc:253140}需要一件{item:10008}（裁缝），Talra需要一件{item:5739}（制皮）。传承的外交家最多增加10%。",
	["From Revered on only {quest:92811} is left: Revered to Exalted is 21,000, 28 turn-ins, 140 totems."] = "崇敬后只剩 {quest:92811}：崇敬到崇拜需要 21,000 点，即交还 28 次，共 140 个图腾。",
	["From Revered on only {quest:92812} is left: Revered to Exalted is 21,000, 28 turn-ins, 140 totems. Nothing is sold for standing; the recipes below need only totems."] = "达到崇敬后，只剩{quest:92812}：崇敬到崇拜需要21,000，即交还28次、140个图腾。声望等级不会解锁商品；下方配方仅需图腾。",
	["Gelkis Stamper"] = "吉尔吉斯踩踏者",
	["Gelkis Windchaser"] = "吉尔吉斯逐风者",
	["Gelkis and Magram Centaur Reputation"] = "吉尔吉斯和玛格拉姆半人马声望",
	["Gelkis: the Kolkar camps"] = "吉尔吉斯：科卡尔营地",
	["Gelkis: the {quest:93034}"] = "吉尔吉斯：{quest:93034}",
	["Gelkis: totems and kills to Honored"] = "吉尔吉斯：交还图腾并击杀敌人至尊敬",
	["Gelkis: totems to Exalted"] = "吉尔吉斯：交图腾到崇拜",
