G["forever/reputation/darkspear-islands"] = {
	["Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor: play games"] = "暗矛群岛荣誉奖章：参加战场对局",
	["Darkspear Islands Reputation"] = "暗矛群岛声望",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Darkspear Islands\" and opens the epics: gloves in plate, mail, leather and cloth for levels 50 and 60 ({item:271940}, Gloves, Handguards and Handwraps, 3g94s to 15g16s) and level 60 shoulders in every armor type ({item:271955}, Shoulders, Spaulders, Mantle, Epaulets, Shoulderpads and Shoulderguards, 9g44s to 16g86s). The {item:276504} comes from a short questline that Exalted opens here."] = "崇拜会给予传承点数“暗矛群岛主宰”，并开放史诗装备：适合 50 和 60 级的板甲、锁甲、皮甲和布甲手套（{item:271940}、手套、护手和裹手，3 金 94 银至 15 金 16 银），以及适合 60 级、涵盖所有护甲类型的肩部装备（{item:271955}等各类护肩，9 金 44 银至 16 金 86 银）。崇拜还会在这里开放一条简短任务线，奖励 {item:276504}。",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Darkspear Islands\" and opens the epics: gloves in plate, mail, leather and cloth for levels 50 and 60 ({item:272095}, Gloves, Handguards and Handwraps, 3g94s to 15g16s) and level 60 shoulders in every armor type ({item:272105}, Shoulders, Spaulders, Mantle, Epaulets, Shoulderpads and Shoulderguards, 9g44s to 16g86s). The {item:276502} comes from a short questline that Exalted opens here."] = "崇拜会给予传承点数“暗矛群岛主宰”，并开放史诗装备：适合 50 和 60 级的板甲、锁甲、皮甲和布甲手套（{item:272095}、手套、护手和裹手，3 金 94 银至 15 金 16 银），以及适合 60 级、涵盖所有护甲类型的肩部装备（{item:272105}等各类护肩，9 金 44 银至 16 金 86 银）。崇拜还会在这里开放一条简短任务线，奖励 {item:276502}。",
	["Forever's new battleground: its gear comes for every bracket from 30, and Exalted gives a Legacy Point."] = "无限的新战场：从30级起每个等级段都有其装备，崇拜可获得1点传承点数。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:263569}, the quartermaster at {area:385}: the trinkets {item:271903} and {item:271904} for levels 33 and 48 (1g49s to 11g85s), and food, bandages and draughts for the battleground. A Theramore care package for Friendly also exists in Forever's data."] = "从友善到尊敬需要 6000 点声望。友善后，{area:385} 的军需官 {npc:263569} 会解锁首批奖励：适用于 33 和 48 级的饰品 {item:271903} 与 {item:271904}（1 金 49 银至 11 金 85 银），以及战场食物、绷带和饮剂。无限数据中还存在一份友善可领的塞拉摩医疗包。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:263570}, the quartermaster beside {npc:275276}: the trinkets {item:272059} and {item:272060} for levels 33 and 48 (1g49s to 11g85s), and food, bandages and draughts for the battleground (5s to 20s). A Darkspear care package for Friendly also exists in Forever's data."] = "友善到尊敬需要6000声望。友善时，{npc:275276}旁的军需官{npc:263570}开放首批奖励：供33级和48级使用的饰品{item:272059}和{item:272060}（1金49银到11金85银），以及战场专用食物、绷带和饮剂（5银到20银）。无限服数据中还存在一个友善可领的暗矛补给包。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. Honored opens {item:271913}, {item:271908}, {item:271917} and {item:271907} for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (1g11s to 12g6s): rings, neck and cloak that fit the bracket you are in."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000声望。尊敬后解锁适合28、38、48和58级的{item:271913}、{item:271908}、{item:271917}和{item:271907}（1金11银至12金6银）：包括适合当前等级段的戒指、项链和披风。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. Honored opens {item:272064}, {item:272068}, {item:272072} and {item:272063} for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (1g11s to 12g6s): rings, neck and cloak that fit the bracket you are in."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000声望。尊敬后解锁适合28、38、48和58级的{item:272064}、{item:272068}、{item:272072}和{item:272063}（1金11银至12金6银）：包括适合当前等级段的戒指、项链和披风。",
	["Master of Darkspear Islands: a Legacy Point at Exalted"] = "暗矛群岛大师：崇拜时获得1点传承点数",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. Forever has not said how much a game pays by itself; the sure part is the Brigadier General's 100 for every 3 marks, which is one win, so at most 30 wins from Neutral even before the games' own reputation. Each new bracket (40, 50, 60) brings a new first win for {npc:275273} (200) and a new first mark quest (150)."] = "中立到友善需要3000声望。无限尚未说明每场战场本身奖励多少；确定的是准将每收3枚奖章奖励100，而赢一场就能获得3枚，因此即使不计战场本身声望，从中立开始也最多需30场胜利。每进入新的等级段（40、50、60），都能重新完成{npc:275273}的首次胜利任务（200）及首次奖章任务（150）。",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. Forever has not said how much a game pays by itself; the sure part is the Warbringer's 100 for every 3 marks, which is one win, so at most 30 wins from Neutral even before the games' own reputation. Each new bracket (40, 50, 60) brings a new first win for {npc:275276} (200) and a new first mark quest (150)."] = "中立到友善需要3000声望。无限尚未说明每场战场本身奖励多少；确定的是战争使者每收3枚奖章奖励100，而赢一场就能获得3枚，因此即使不计战场本身声望，从中立开始也最多需30场胜利。每进入新的等级段（40、50、60），都能重新完成{npc:275276}的首次胜利任务（200）及首次奖章任务（150）。",
	["Reputation · Battlegrounds"] = "声望 · 战场",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58: {item:271924} (two-handed axe), {item:271928} (dagger), Guerrilla's Jagged Mace and {item:271932} (off-hand), 1g44s to 37g15s."] = "从崇敬到崇拜需要21000声望，占整个冲声望过程的一半。崇敬后可购买28、38、48和58级的武器：{item:271924}（双手斧）、{item:271928}（匕首）、游击队的锯齿战锤 和 {item:271932}（副手），价格1金币44银币至37金币15银币。",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58: {item:272079} (two-handed axe), {item:272083} (dagger), {item:272091} (mace) and the {item:272087} (off-hand), 1g44s to 37g15s."] = "从崇敬到崇拜需要21000声望，占整个冲声望过程的一半。崇敬后可购买28、38、48和58级的武器：{item:272079}（双手斧）、{item:272083}（匕首）、{item:272091}（锤）和 {item:272087}（副手），价格1金币44银币至37金币15银币。",
	["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time ({quest:98887}), then 100 for every 3 more. The nearest stand at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}; others in {zone:1456} and the {zone:1458}, at {area:321} and by the {zone:1459} gate. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "{npc:15350} 首次收取 3 枚暗矛群岛荣誉奖章，奖励 150 点声望（{quest:98887}），之后每 3 枚奖励 100 点。最近的任务给予者在 {zone:1413} 北部的摩尔沙和 {zone:1454}；其他位于 {zone:1456}、{zone:1458}、{area:321} 及 {zone:1459} 大门旁。无限的 PvP 装备除了荣誉，还要消耗荣誉奖章：交还前先想好要买什么。{zone:2524} 的奖章最多只能携带 30 枚：达到上限前及时交还或花掉。",
	["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98889}), then keeps taking 3 more. The nearest stand at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15350} 在每个等级段首次接受 3 枚暗矛群岛荣誉奖章时，会提供 150 点声望（{quest:98889}），之后仍会持续接受每 3 枚奖章。最近的战争使者在 {zone:1413} 北部的摩尔沙和 {zone:1454}。无限的 PvP 装备除了荣誉外也需要荣誉奖章：交还前先决定想换什么。你最多只能携带 30 枚 {zone:2524} 奖章。",
	["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98891}), then keeps taking 3 more. The nearest stand at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15350} 在每个等级段首次接受 3 枚暗矛群岛荣誉奖章时，会提供 150 点声望（{quest:98891}），之后仍会持续接受每 3 枚奖章。最近的战争使者在 {zone:1413} 北部的摩尔沙和 {zone:1454}。无限的 PvP 装备除了荣誉外也需要荣誉奖章：交还前先决定想换什么。你最多只能携带 30 枚 {zone:2524} 奖章。",
	["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98893}), then keeps taking 3 more. The nearest stand at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15350} 在每个等级段首次接受 3 枚暗矛群岛荣誉奖章时，会提供 150 点声望（{quest:98893}），之后仍会持续接受每 3 枚奖章。最近的战争使者在 {zone:1413} 北部的摩尔沙和 {zone:1454}。无限的 PvP 装备除了荣誉外也需要荣誉奖章：交还前先决定想换什么。你最多只能携带 30 枚 {zone:2524} 奖章。",
	["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time ({quest:98895}), then 100 for every 3 more. He stands in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440}, at {area:320} in the {zone:1417} and at both gates of {zone:1459}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "{npc:15351} 首次接受 3 枚暗矛群岛荣誉奖章时，会提供 150 点声望（{quest:98895}），之后每 3 枚提供 100 点。他位于 {zone:1453}、{zone:1455} 和 {zone:1457}，以及 {zone:1440} 南部的 {area:3319}、{zone:1417} 的 {area:320} 和 {zone:1459} 两侧大门处。无限的 PvP 装备除了荣誉外也需要荣誉奖章：交还前先决定想换什么。你最多只能携带 30 枚 {zone:2524} 奖章：达到上限前就要交还或花掉。",
	["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98897}), then keeps taking 3 more. He stands in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440} and at {area:320}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "每个等级段首次向 {npc:15351} 交还3枚暗矛群岛荣誉奖章，可获得150点声望（{quest:98897}），之后仍可每次交还3枚。他在 {zone:1453}、{zone:1455}、{zone:1457}、{zone:1440} 南部的 {area:3319} 和 {area:320} 都有出现。无限服的PvP装备除了荣誉外，也需要荣誉奖章：交还前先决定想买什么。最多只能携带30枚 {zone:2524} 奖章。",
	["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98899}), then keeps taking 3 more. He stands in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440} and at {area:320}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "每个等级段首次向 {npc:15351} 交还3枚暗矛群岛荣誉奖章，可获得150点声望（{quest:98899}），之后仍可每次交还3枚。他在 {zone:1453}、{zone:1455}、{zone:1457}、{zone:1440} 南部的 {area:3319} 和 {area:320} 都有出现。无限服的PvP装备除了荣誉外，也需要荣誉奖章：交还前先决定想买什么。最多只能携带30枚 {zone:2524} 奖章。",
	["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98901}), then keeps taking 3 more. He stands in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440} and at {area:320}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "每个等级段首次向 {npc:15351} 交还3枚暗矛群岛荣誉奖章，可获得150点声望（{quest:98901}），之后仍可每次交还3枚。他在 {zone:1453}、{zone:1455}、{zone:1457}、{zone:1440} 南部的 {area:3319} 和 {area:320} 都有出现。无限服的PvP装备除了荣誉外，也需要荣誉奖章：交还前先决定想买什么。最多只能携带30枚 {zone:2524} 奖章。",
	["The {zone:2524} lie off the coast of {zone:1445}: 15 against 15, from level 30. Hold the four capture points to gain points, faster the more you hold, and carry the flag from the middle to a base your team holds for more; the first team to 2000 points wins. The sea kills: cross on the bridges. Queue at any battlemaster or step through the portal here at the {area:391}, north of {area:392}. {npc:275276} pays 200 reputation for your first win. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:2524} 位于 {zone:1445} 近海：30级起可参与，15对15。占领四个据点以获得积分，占得越多得分越快；将中央的旗帜带回己方占领的基地还能获得额外积分，率先达到2000分的队伍获胜。海水会致命：请走桥。可找任意战场军官排队，或从这里 {area:392} 北边 {area:391} 的传送门进入。首次获胜后，{npc:275276} 会奖励200点声望。无限服的传承天赋“外交家” 特长可让本指南中的所有声望数值最多提高10%。",
	["The {zone:2524} lie off the coast of {zone:1445}: 15 against 15, from level 30. Hold the four capture points to gain points, faster the more you hold, and carry the flag from the middle to a base your team holds for more; the first team to 2000 points wins. The sea kills: cross on the bridges. Queue at any battlemaster or step through the portal here at {area:385}, south of {area:392}. {npc:275273} pays 200 reputation for your first win. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:2524}位于{zone:1445}外海：15人对15人，30级起可参加。控制四个占领点来获得分数，占得越多得分越快；还可将中央旗帜带回己方控制的基地获得额外分数，先到2000分的一方获胜。海水会致命：请走桥。在任意战场军官处排队，或从这里{area:392}南方{area:385}的传送门进入。首次获胜可从{npc:275273}处获得200声望。无限服传承的外交家特长使本指南中每项数值最多增加10%。",
	["after a win"] = "赢得一场后",
