	["Every town to Honored"] = "所有城镇至尊敬",
	["Every town to Revered"] = "所有城镇达到崇敬",
	["Five goblin towns share one reputation family, the Steamwheedle Cartel: {faction:470}, {faction:21}, {faction:369}, {faction:577} and Forever's new {faction:2827} in the {zone:2548}. Everyone starts each at Neutral (500 into it). A gain with one town gives the others half as much; a quest for the Cartel itself, like {npc:14637}'s, pays every town in full. Losses spread the same way: a {npc:4624} or any goblin of the towns costs 125 (half that with the other towns), and Bloodsail Buccaneers reputation is earned only that way. {npc:14637} camps on the road through central {zone:1444} and works for anyone, even players the goblins hate. His first two quests are level 48: in Classic they paid less once you were 6 or more levels above them (a fifth at 57 and up), but they open his repeatables, which are level 55 and pay in full at 60."] = "五座地精城镇共享同一个声望阵营——热砂港财团：{faction:470}、{faction:21}、{faction:369}、{faction:577}，以及无限在{zone:2548}新增的{faction:2827}。每个人每座城镇都从中立开始（已有500点进度）。在一座城镇获得的声望，会将其余城镇各分到一半；而像{npc:14637}这样直接为财团做的任务，则全额计入每座城镇。损失也照此分摊：一个{npc:4624}或这些城镇的任何地精会损失125点（其余城镇减半），血帆海盗的声望只能靠这种方式获得。{npc:14637}在穿越{zone:1444}中部的路旁扎营，为任何人工作，甚至包括地精们憎恨的玩家。他的头两个任务是48级：经典旧世中，当你高出它们6级或更多时收益会减少（57级及以上只有五分之一），但完成它们会开启他的可重复任务——那些是55级，60级时全额给付。",
	["Forever's goblin quartermasters: gear for levels 20 to 50 at Friendly and Honored"] = "无限的地精军需官：友善和尊敬声望下的20到50级装备",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 240 of {npc:14637}'s turn-ins, or 40 Free Knot runs, or a mix. Nothing can be saved up: residue and cores drop only while their quest is in your log, and you can carry one {item:18250} at a time, so hand each in before the next run. Honored opens each quartermaster's blue items."] = "从友善到尊敬需要 6,000 点：交还 240 次 {npc:14637} 的任务，或刷 40 次解救诺特，也可以两者混用。无法提前囤积：只有任务在日志中时才会掉落残渣和核心，而 {item:18250} 一次只能携带一个，因此每次刷完都要先交还再进行下一次。尊敬后会解锁各军需官的蓝色物品。",
	["From now on {npc:14637} offers {quest:7725} (10 residue) and {quest:7726} (6 cores), again and again: 25 reputation with every town each time."] = "从现在起，{npc:14637} 会反复提供 {quest:7725}（10 个残渣）和 {quest:7726}（6 个核心）：每次给每座城镇 25 点声望。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000 more: 480 of {npc:14637}'s turn-ins (4,800 residue) or 80 Free Knot runs. Revered opens the five cosmetic hats, the reason most players do this. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%."] = "从尊敬到崇敬还需12,000点：相当于完成 {npc:14637} 的交还任务480次（4,800份残渣），或解救诺特80次。崇敬可解锁五顶装饰帽，大多数玩家就是为此而刷。传承天赋“外交家” 最多增加10%。",
	["Neutral 500 to Friendly is 2,500 with each town. The quests above pay every town up to 700 ({npc:14637}'s two 300, {npc:10267}'s 150, the first Free Knot 150 and the first Ogre Suit 100; less when you are well above their level); {npc:14637}'s repeatables do the rest, 25 to every town each: 10 residue (ten giants) or 6 cores (about twelve elementals). The towns' own quests count too, each giving the other towns half: {faction:470}'s in the {zone:1413} (levels 10-25, about 4,300: the Samophlange chain 625, {npc:3446}'s errands, the Wizzlecrank and Gilthares escorts 150 each), {faction:21}'s in Stranglethorn, Arathi and the {zone:1418} (30-50, about 6,500: the three OOX robot rescues 250 each, An OOX of Your Own 200, Stranglethorn Fever 200, Facing Negolash 200, the Sunken Treasure chain at {area:327}), {faction:369}'s in {zone:1446} (43-55, about 3,000: the {item:8548} 200, Wastewander Justice 100 each, the WANTED posters) and {faction:577}'s in {zone:1452} (52-60, about 1,450: {npc:9298}'s Winterfall chain, Umi's yeti quests). Forever adds a few low ones: A Simmering Storm and Stormy Potential in {zone:1411} and WANTED: Bruuz ({faction:470} 100 each), Important Heirlooms in {zone:1455} ({faction:369} 100). In Classic they pay in full only while at most 5 levels below you; past that each level takes a fifth off, down to a fifth. Kills help while they are not grey, 5 each: Southsea pirates in the {zone:1413} for {faction:470} and in {zone:1446} for {faction:369} and Stranglethorn's Venture Co. camps for {faction:21}, up to the end of Honored; Wastewander bandits for {faction:369} and Bloodsail pirates for {faction:21} only up to the end of Neutral. Friendly opens each quartermaster's first gear."] = "中立500点到友善需要每座城镇2,500点。上述任务每座城镇最多给700点（{npc:14637}的两个任务各300，{npc:10267}的150，第一次“解救诺特”150，第一次食人魔套装100；当你高出任务等级很多时会给得更少）；其余靠{npc:14637}的可重复任务，每次每座城镇25点：10个残渣（十个巨人）或6个核心（约十二个元素生物）。各城镇自己的任务也算，且给其余城镇一半：{faction:470}在{zone:1413}的任务（10-25级，约4,300点：采样器任务链625，{npc:3446}的跑腿任务，维兹克兰克和吉尔萨雷斯护送各150），{faction:21}在荆棘谷、阿拉希和{zone:1418}的任务（30-50级，约6,500点：三次OOX机器人救援各250，《你自己的OOX》200，《荆棘谷热》200，《直面内格拉什》200，以及{area:327}的沉没的宝藏任务链），{faction:369}在{zone:1446}的任务（43-55级，约3,000点：{item:8548} 200，《废土正义》每个100，通缉告示）以及{faction:577}在{zone:1452}的任务（52-60级，约1,450点：{npc:9298}的冬泉任务链、乌米的雪人任务）。无限还加了几个低级任务：{zone:1411}的《酝酿的风暴》和《风暴潜能》，以及《通缉：布鲁兹》（{faction:470}各100）；{zone:1455}的《重要传家宝》（{faction:369} 100）。在经典旧世中，只有当你最多比任务低5级时才全额给付；再往上每高一级扣掉五分之一，最低到五分之一。击杀在怪物尚未变灰时有用，每只5点：{zone:1413}的南海海盗给{faction:470}、{zone:1446}的南海海盗给{faction:369}，以及荆棘谷的风险投资公司营地给{faction:21}，直到尊敬结束；废土强盗给{faction:369}、血帆海盗给{faction:21}，只到中立结束。友善会开放各军需官的第一批装备。",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 more with each town: 840 of {npc:14637}'s turn-ins or 140 Free Knot runs. No quartermaster sells anything for Exalted: this is for the title bar only."] = "每座城镇从崇敬到崇拜还需要21,000：交还{npc:14637}的任务840次，或解救诺特140趟。没有军需官出售要求崇拜的商品：只为声望栏上的等级。",
	["Scalding Broodlings east of {area:251}"] = "{area:251} 东边的炽热小龙",
	["Scalding Broodlings west of {area:251}"] = "{area:251}西侧的炽热小龙",
	["Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays"] = "海元素和巨型海元素",
	["Southsea Dock Worker"] = "南海码头工人",
	["Southsea Freebooter"] = "南海劫掠者",
	["Southsea Pirate"] = "南海海盗",
	["Southsea Swashbuckler"] = "南海剑客",
	["Souvenir Sea Shell, Honored"] = "纪念海螺，尊敬",
	["Steamwheedle Cartel Reputation"] = "热砂港声望",
	["The Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays (level 47-49) drift along the {area:1108} and in the shallows below the giants: about half drop a {item:18958}."] = "海元素和巨型海元素（47—49级）在 {area:1108} 沿岸及巨人下方的浅滩游荡：约有一半会掉落 {item:18958}。",
	["The Southsea pirates of {area:1336} (level 44-45) on the east coast of {zone:1446} give {faction:369} 5 each up to the end of Honored, and the other towns half. Two quests at {area:977} pay 100 {faction:369} each: {quest:8366} (10 of each pirate) and {quest:8365} (20 Southsea Pirate Hats, one in ten pirates). From level 56 the pirates are grey and pay little: skip this step then."] = "{zone:1446} 东海岸 {area:1336} 的南海海盗（44-45 级），每名给予 {faction:369} 5 点声望，直到尊敬满，其他城镇获得一半。{area:977} 的两个任务各奖励 100 点 {faction:369} 声望：{quest:8366}（每种海盗各 10 名）和 {quest:8365}（20 顶南海海盗帽，海盗掉率十分之一）。56 级起，这些海盗会变成灰色，声望很少：到时跳过本步骤。",
	["Use {item:18904} on a living giant ({npc:5357}, {npc:5358}, or a Shore, Deep or {npc:5361}, level 47-50) and it shrinks into a zapped version; kill that for its {item:18956}, one every time. The Land Walkers and Cliff Giants in the north-west hills are the thickest; the striders walk the coast and the shallows. The shrinker lasts two hours: if it runs out, abandon the quest and take it again."] = "对一只活着的巨人使用 {item:18904}（{npc:5357}、{npc:5358}，或海岸巨人、深海巨人、{npc:5361}，47—50级），它会缩成被压缩的形态；击杀后获得 {item:18956}，每只必掉一个。西北山丘的大地行者和峭壁巨人最密集；海巨人在海岸和浅滩行走。压缩器持续两小时：如果到期，就放弃任务再重接。",
	["Zapped giants"] = "被缩小的巨人",
	["{area:1336}, below 56"] = "{area:1336}，低于56级",
