	["{npc:10267}, a goblin at {area:251} in the north of the {zone:1428}, has a chain that pays every town 150 and {faction:577} 150 more. Use her {item:12284} on a broodling, kill it while the device holds it, and pick up the {quest:4726} it leaves. The device takes only Black and Scalding Broodlings, not the Flamescale Broodlings of the west: Scalding Broodlings (level 53-54) roam just west and east of {area:251}, Black Broodlings (51-52) the north-east corner of the zone, the thickest group. They are few and spread out: the path passes both and ends among the Black Broodlings."] = "{zone:1428}北部{area:251}的地精{npc:10267}有一条任务线，为每座城镇奖励150声望，并额外奖励150点{faction:577}声望。对小龙使用她的{item:12284}，在装置控制住它时击杀，再捡起留下的{quest:4726}。装置只对黑色小龙和炽热小龙有效，对西边的火鳞小龙无效：炽热小龙（53-54级）就在{area:251}东西两侧不远处，黑色小龙（51-52级）在本地区东北角，那里最密集。它们数量不多、分布分散：这条路线会经过两种小龙，最后到黑色小龙群中。",
	["{npc:14338} sits shackled in Dire Maul North, the Gordok ogres' wing (a five-player dungeon from level 57: group up). Every {item:18250} frees him once: 150 to every town, and he is shackled again on your next run. Gordok ogres drop the keys (about one in fifteen; {npc:14321} one in seven): a full run of the wing usually brings one. His {item:18258} pays 100 the first time and 50 after, for 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 {item:8170}, 2 {item:14341} and the {item:18240} from the basket in the wing. Under 57 when you get here? Unskip this step later."] = "{npc:14338}被锁在厄运之槌北区，也就是戈多克食人魔所在区域（57级起的五人地下城：请组队）。每把{item:18250}可释放他一次：所有城镇各150声望，下次进本他又会被锁住。戈多克食人魔掉落钥匙（约十五分之一；{npc:14321}约七分之一）：完整打通该区通常能获得一把。他的{item:18258}首次奖励100，之后50，需要4卷符文布卷、8个{item:8170}、2个{item:14341}，以及本区篮子里的{item:18240}。来到这里时还没到57级？以后再取消跳过此步骤。",
	["{npc:255897} sells {faction:2827}'s rewards in {area:16727}, on the east coast of the {zone:2548}, alongside general goods. Friendly, level 40 gear: {item:276200} 2g 74s (Stamina, attack power), {item:276201} 2g 94s (Intellect, Spirit), {item:276202} 2g 36s (Agility, Spirit). Honored: {item:276203}, a two-handed weapon, 9g 46s (Stamina, Strength, Agility); {item:276204}, a shield, 3g 80s (Stamina, spell damage, healing). Revered: {item:276199}, 10g."] = "{npc:255897}在{zone:2548}东海岸的{area:16727}出售{faction:2827}奖励，也出售杂货。友善，40级装备：{item:276200}，2金74银（耐力、攻击强度）；{item:276201}，2金94银（智力、精神）；{item:276202}，2金36银（敏捷、精神）。尊敬：{item:276203}，双手武器，9金46银（耐力、力量、敏捷）；{item:276204}，盾牌，3金80银（耐力、法术伤害、治疗）。崇敬：{item:276199}，10金币。",
	["{npc:265574}, {faction:470}'s quartermaster, by the docks. Friendly, level 20 gear: {item:274740} 41s (Stamina, Agility), {item:274741} 54s (Stamina, spell power), {item:274742} 34s (Intellect, Agility). Honored: {item:274743}, an off-hand, 66s (Intellect, Spirit); {item:274744}, a one-handed mace, 1g 65s (Stamina, Strength). Revered: the {item:274021}, a cosmetic hat, 2g."] = "{faction:470} 的军需官 {npc:265574} 在码头旁。友善，20级装备：{item:274740}，41银币（耐力、敏捷）；{item:274741}，54银币（耐力、法术强度）；{item:274742}，34银币（智力、敏捷）。尊敬：副手 {item:274743}，66银币（智力、精神）；单手锤 {item:274744}，1金币65银币（耐力、力量）。崇敬：装饰帽 {item:274021}，2金币。",
	["{npc:265575}, {faction:21}'s quartermaster. Friendly, level 30 gear: {item:274745} 1g 10s (Strength, Agility), {item:274746} 1g 48s (healing and spell damage), {item:274747} 1g 3s (Intellect, Spirit). Honored: {item:274748}, a gun, 3g 11s (attack power, Stamina); Souvenir Sea Shell, a necklace, 1g 66s (health regeneration, Stamina). Revered: {item:274022}, 5g."] = "{npc:265575}是{faction:21}的军需官。友善，30级装备：{item:274745} 1金10银（力量、敏捷），{item:274746} 1金48银（治疗和法术伤害），{item:274747} 1金3银（智力、精神）。尊敬：{item:274748}，枪，3金11银（攻击强度、耐力）；纪念海螺，项链，1金66银（生命回复、耐力）。崇敬：{item:274022}，5金。",
	["{npc:265575}, {faction:21}'s quartermaster. Friendly, level 30 gear: {item:274745} 1g 10s (Strength, Agility), {item:274746} 1g 48s (healing and spell damage), {item:274747} 1g 3s (Intellect, Spirit). Honored: {item:274748}, a gun, 3g 11s (attack power, Stamina); {item:274749}, a necklace, 1g 66s (health regeneration, Stamina). Revered: {item:274022}, 5g."] = "{npc:265575}，{faction:21}军需官。友善，30级装备：{item:274745}，1金10银（力量、敏捷）；{item:274746}，1金48银（治疗和法术伤害）；{item:274747}，1金3银（智力、精神）。尊敬：枪械{item:274748}，3金11银（攻击强度、耐力）；项链{item:274749}，1金66银（生命值回复、耐力）。崇敬：{item:274022}，5金。",
	["{npc:265576}, {faction:369}'s quartermaster. Friendly, level 40 gear: {item:274750} 2g 74s (Intellect, healing, spell damage), {item:274751} 2g 94s (Agility, attack power), {item:274752}, a cloak, 2g 36s (Spirit, spell power). Honored: {item:274753}, a one-handed weapon, 9g 46s (Strength, Agility); {item:274754}, a ring, 3g 80s (Strength, Stamina). Revered: the {item:274023}, 10g."] = "{npc:265576}，{faction:369} 军需官。友善，40 级装备：{item:274750}，2 金 74 银（智力、治疗、法术伤害）；{item:274751}，2 金 94 银（敏捷、攻击强度）；披风 {item:274752}，2 金 36 银（精神、法术强度）。尊敬：单手武器 {item:274753}，9 金 46 银（力量、敏捷）；戒指 {item:274754}，3 金 80 银（力量、耐力）。崇敬：{item:274023}，10 金币。",
	["{npc:265577}, {faction:577}'s quartermaster. Friendly, level 50 gear: {item:274755} 3g 10s (Spirit, Intellect), {item:274756} 5g 84s (Agility, Stamina, frost resistance), {item:274757} 4g 68s (Agility, attack power), {item:274758}, a chest, 10g 96s (Strength, Stamina). Honored, three trinkets at about 7g 55s: {item:274759} (nature resistance), {item:274760} (frost resistance) and {item:274761} (shadow resistance), the last two with a use. Revered: {item:274024}, 25g."] = "{npc:265577}，{faction:577} 的军需官。友善，50级装备：{item:274755} 3金币10银币（精神、智力）、{item:274756} 5金币84银币（敏捷、耐力、冰霜抗性）、{item:274757} 4金币68银币（敏捷、攻击强度）、胸甲 {item:274758} 10金币96银币（力量、耐力）。尊敬，三件饰品各约7金币55银币：{item:274759}（自然抗性）、{item:274760}（冰霜抗性）和 {item:274761}（暗影抗性），后两件带有使用效果。崇敬：{item:274024}，25金币。",
	["{quest:4726}, left by the broodlings"] = "{quest:4726}，小龙留下的",
	["{quest:4808} is in {faction:577}. The Chillwind Chimaeras (level 55-57) south-west of {faction:577} drop the horns one time in five."] = "{quest:4808} 位于 {faction:577}。{faction:577} 西南面的冰风奇美拉（55—57级）掉落角的概率为五分之一。",
	["{quest:4810} gives 50 to every town. Her later quests, Egg Freezing (150 to every town) and Egg Collection (200), are done in the Rookery of Upper Blackrock Spire, a ten-player dungeon: take them up with your group."] = "{quest:4810} 给每座城镇50声望。她后续的“冷冻龙蛋”（每座城镇150）和“收集龙蛋”（200）在十人地下城黑石塔上层的孵化间完成：随小队一起上去时做。",
	["{quest:5525}, again on every later run: 150"] = "{quest:5525}，之后每次进本都能再做：150点",
	["{quest:5525}: 150 to every town"] = "{quest:5525}：每座城镇 150 点声望",
	["{quest:7003}: 150 to every town"] = "{quest:7003}：每座城镇 150 点声望",
	["{quest:7721}: 150 to every town"] = "{quest:7721}：每座城镇 150 点声望",
	["{quest:7725}: 10 residue"] = "{quest:7725}：10 个残渣。",
	["{quest:7726}: 6 cores"] = "{quest:7726}：6个核心",
}

G["forever/reputation/thorium-brotherhood"] = {
	["10 {item:11370}: 50"] = "10个{item:11370}：50",
	["2 {item:17012}: 150"] = "2个{item:17012}：150",
	["Back to {area:1446}"] = "返回{area:1446}",
	["Belt, 20 Thorium Bars"] = "腰带，20块瑟银锭",
	["Blacksmiths with 265 skill can buy their way up with Thorium Bars: {npc:14567} in {area:976} trades the Imperial Plate plans for bars, and each pays Brotherhood reputation. {quest:7652} opens them (100). Belt 20 bars (100), Bracer 20 (100), Shoulders 20 (100), Boots 40 (150), Helm 50 (200), Chest 60 (200), Leggings 60 (200): 1,150 reputation for 270 Thorium Bars. They count at any standing, so do them before Burninate's turn-ins."] = "技能265的铁匠可以用瑟银锭提升声望：{area:976}的{npc:14567}用君王板甲图纸交换瑟银锭，每个任务都奖励兄弟会声望。{quest:7652}会解锁这些任务（100）。腰带20锭（100）、护腕20锭（100）、护肩20锭（100）、战靴40锭（150）、头盔50锭（200）、胸甲60锭（200）、护腿60锭（200）：270块瑟银锭共换1,150声望。任何声望阶段都算，因此在大铁匠博恩奈特的收集任务之前做。",
	["Boots, 40 Thorium Bars"] = "靴子，40块瑟银锭",
	["Bracer, 20 Thorium Bars"] = "护腕，20块瑟银锭",
	["Carry a {item:17203} ({npc:11988}, the {area:2717}) to {npc:12944} and he offers you a contract: ask about the offer and take it. Handing in the contract with the ingot pays 200 reputation and {item:18592}, the hammer Blacksmiths later join with the {item:17204} into {item:17182}."] = "带着 {item:17203}（来自 {area:2717} 的 {npc:11988}）去找 {npc:12944}，他会给你一份契约：询问他的提议并接受。将契约和锭一并交还，可获得200点声望及 {item:18592}，锻造师之后可将这把锤子与 {item:17204} 合成为 {item:17182}。",
	["Chest, 60 Thorium Bars"] = "胸甲，60块瑟银锭",
	["Coal, 1 per turn-in"] = "煤块，每次交还需要 1 个。",
	["Dark Iron Slaver"] = "黑铁奴隶贩子",
	["Dark Iron Taskmaster"] = "黑铁监工",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6,000 reputation. While you are Friendly Burninate takes {quest:7737} instead: 25 reputation for 4 {item:18945}, 240 turn-ins and 960 residue in all. About a third of the {object:147516} dwarves in {area:1584} drop residue, sometimes several at once; it also sells on the Auction House. {item:11370} or {area:2717} materials at {npc:12944} (next steps) count here too. {npc:12944}'s shop opens at Friendly: {item:16979} 8g, {item:16982} 15g, {item:16983} 16g, {item:17014} 7g, {item:273572} 3g, Transmute Elemental Fire 12g."] = "从友善到尊敬需要6,000点声望。友善期间，大铁匠博恩奈特改为接受 {quest:7737}：用4份 {item:18945} 换取25点，总计需交还240次，消耗960份残渣。{area:1584} 的 {object:147516} 矮人约有三分之一会掉落残渣，有时一次掉好几份；拍卖行也有出售。向 {npc:12944} 交还 {item:11370} 或 {area:2717} 的材料（见后续步骤）在此阶段也有效。友善可解锁 {npc:12944} 的商店：{item:16979}，8金币；{item:16982}，15金币；{item:16983}，16金币；{item:17014}，7金币；{item:273572}，3金币；转化元素火焰，12金币。",
	["Golems and {object:147516} dwarves"] = "魔像和{object:147516}的矮人",
	["Greater Lava Spider"] = "巨型熔岩蜘蛛",
	["Greater Lava Spiders"] = "{npc:5858}",
	["Heavy War Golem"] = "重型战争傀儡",
	["Heavy War Golems and the Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers work all over the floor of the Cauldron below {area:1446}. The {item:18959} drops from Dark Iron Steamsmiths at the furnaces in the middle, the {item:18960} from Dark Iron Lookouts on the southern ridges: about one in ten of each."] = "重型作战傀儡、黑铁工头和黑铁奴隶贩子遍布 {area:1446} 下方大熔炉的底部。{item:18959} 由中部熔炉旁的黑铁锻造师掉落，{item:18960} 由南部山脊上的黑铁哨兵掉落：两者掉率均约为十分之一。",
	["Helm, 50 Thorium Bars"] = "头盔，50块瑟银锭",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation, all of it from {npc:12944} in the Grim Guzzler, the tavern deep in {area:1584}. The way there: with the {item:11000}, open the East Garrison door near the entrance; without it, win the Ring of Law and climb to the East Garrison. Pull the {object:161460} there to lower the bridge to the Manufactory, the only way to the Guzzler. His Favor Amongst the Brotherhood turn-ins never stop counting: 1 {item:17010}, 1 {item:17011} or 1 {item:11382} for 200, 2 {item:17012} for 150, 10 {item:11370} for 50. To Revered that is 60 cores, 160 {item:17012} or 2,400 {item:11370}. The cores and the leather come only from the {area:2717}, which is not among the first raids Blizzard has announced for Forever; until it opens, {item:11370} is the way. Miners with 230 skill find Dark Iron Deposits around the Cauldron in {zone:1427}, across the {zone:1428} and inside {area:1584}, and a deposit now and then gives a {item:11382}; the ore also sells on the Auction House. Honored opens {item:16980} 18g, {item:19156} 6g, {item:19149} 6g, {item:16984} 16g, {item:16989} 9g, {item:19148} 6g, {item:17015} 22g, {item:17016} 22g and {item:273576} 8g."] = "从尊敬到崇敬需要 12,000 点声望，全部来自 {area:1584} 深处酒馆黑铁酒吧中的 {npc:12944}。前往路线：若有 {item:11000}，打开入口附近的东部兵营大门；若没有，先打赢秩序竞技场，再爬上东部兵营。在那里拉动 {object:161460}，放下通往制造厂的桥，这是前往酒吧的唯一路线。他提供的“兄弟会的好感”交还任务始终有效：1 个 {item:17010}、1 个 {item:17011} 或 1 个 {item:11382} 各换 200 点，2 个 {item:17012} 换 150 点，10 个 {item:11370} 换 50 点。升到崇敬需要 60 个核心、160 个 {item:17012} 或 2,400 个 {item:11370}。核心和皮革只来自 {area:2717}，它不在暴雪已公布的无限首批团队副本中；开放之前，只能走 {item:11370} 这条路。技能达到 230 的矿工可在 {zone:1427} 大熔炉周围、{zone:1428} 各处及 {area:1584} 内找到黑铁矿脉，矿脉偶尔也会产出 {item:11382}；矿石也可在拍卖行买到。尊敬后解锁：{item:16980} 18 金、{item:19156} 6 金、{item:19149} 6 金、{item:16984} 16 金、{item:16989} 9 金、{item:19148} 6 金、{item:17015} 22 金、{item:17016} 22 金和 {item:273576} 8 金。",
	["Imperial Plate, for Blacksmiths"] = "君王板甲，供锻造师完成",
	["Incendosaur"] = "炎蜥",
	["Leggings, 60 Thorium Bars"] = "护腿，60块瑟银锭",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 reputation. Burninate takes Restoring Fiery Flux Supplies only while you are Neutral: 25 reputation for 2 Incendosaur Scales, 1 Coal and either 4 Iron Bars, 4 {item:3356} or 10 {item:4234}. These are level 60 quests, so they always pay in full. After the 700 from the {area:1446} quests that is 92 turn-ins: 184 scales (about 60 Incendosaurs), 92 Coal (Burninate sells it at 5 silver: 4g 60s) and 368 Iron Bars, 368 {item:3356} or 920 {item:4234}. If those quests paid you only 140 at 60, it is 115 turn-ins: 230 scales, 115 Coal (5g 75s) and 460 bars or {item:3356} or 1,150 {item:4234}. Miners smelt the bars from {item:2772}, herbalists pick {item:3356}, skinners get {item:4234} from beasts of level 28 to 40; all three sell on the Auction House. Pick whichever is cheapest for you, or mix them. Blacksmiths who did the Imperial Plate quests need 46 fewer turn-ins."] = "中立到友善需要 3,000 点声望。只有中立时，大铁匠博恩奈特才会接受炽热助熔剂的补给：2 个熏火龙的鳞片、1 个煤块，再加 4 块铁锭、4 个 {item:3356} 或 10 个 {item:4234} 任选一种，换 25 点声望。这些是 60 级任务，因此始终奖励全额。算上 {area:1446} 任务给的 700 点后，需要交还 92 次：184 个鳞片（约 60 只熏火龙）、92 个煤块（大铁匠博恩奈特售价每个 5 银币：共 4 金 60 银），以及 368 块铁锭、368 个 {item:3356} 或 920 个 {item:4234}。如果那些任务在 60 级时只给了你 140 点，就需要交还 115 次：230 个鳞片、115 个煤块（5 金 75 银），以及 460 块铁锭或 {item:3356}，或 1,150 个 {item:4234}。采矿者用 {item:2772} 熔炼铁锭，草药师采集 {item:3356}，剥皮者从 28 至 40 级野兽身上获取 {item:4234}；三种都可以在拍卖行购买。选对你最便宜的，也可以混着交。做过君王板甲任务的锻造师可以少交 46 次。",
	["Only if you take the {item:4234} turn-in below and skin it yourself: the wyverns, basilisks and scorpids here (level 28 to 40) yield it. Ten per turn-in."] = "仅在打算完成下方 {item:4234} 交还任务并自行剥皮时进行：这里的双足飞龙、蜥蜴和蝎子（28至40级）都可剥出。每次交还十张。",
	["Only if you take the {item:4234} turn-in below and skin it yourself: the yetis and mountain lions here (level 28 to 40) yield it. Ten per turn-in."] = "仅在你选择下方 {item:4234} 交还任务，并自行剥皮获取材料时进行：这里的雪人和山地狮（28 至 40 级）会产出这种皮。每次交还需要十个。",
	["Optional, and it saves every later trip to {npc:12944} the Ring of Law fight. {npc:8888} is a ghost in the middle of {area:1445}: only the dead see him, so die in the mountain and walk to his tomb as a spirit. He sends you after {npc:9056} in {area:1584}, who always drops {item:10999}; place it on {npc:8888}'s monument in the Shrine of Thaurissan and the {item:11000} falls out. {area:1584} is a five-player dungeon: group up."] = "可选，完成后每次再去找 {npc:12944} 都能省去秩序竞技场的战斗。{npc:8888} 是 {area:1445} 中央的幽灵：只有死者能看见他，因此先在山内死去，再以灵魂状态走到他的墓前。他会让你去找 {area:1584} 的 {npc:9056}，后者必定掉落 {item:10999}；把它放在索瑞森神殿中 {npc:8888} 的纪念碑上，就会掉出 {item:11000}。{area:1584} 是五人地下城：请组队。",
	["Reputation · Raids and dungeons"] = "声望 · 团队副本与地下城",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 more: 105 cores or Bloods, 280 {item:17012} or 4,200 {item:11370}. The {area:2717} materials come from the raid, so a guild or the auction house does most of the work. Revered opens {item:19165} 9g, {item:19157} 9g, {item:19162} 9g, {item:19163} 9g, {item:17013} 18g, {item:19164} 8g, {item:16988} 20g, {item:19166} 7g, Blackfury 7g and {item:273577} 10g. Exalted opens the epic weapon plans {item:19170}, Blackguard and Nightfall (12g each) and {item:20039} 8g."] = "从崇敬到崇拜还需21,000：105个核心或鲜血、280张 {item:17012}，或4,200块 {item:11370}。{area:2717} 材料来自团队副本，因此主要靠公会或拍卖行解决。崇敬后可购买 {item:19165} 9金币、{item:19157} 9金币、{item:19162} 9金币、{item:19163} 9金币、{item:17013} 18金币、{item:19164} 8金币、{item:16988} 20金币、{item:19166} 7金币、黑色怒火 7金币和 {item:273577} 10金币。崇拜后可购买史诗武器图纸 {item:19170}、黑色卫士和德拉克·奈特弗（各12金币），以及 {item:20039} 8金币。",
	["Shoulders, 20 Thorium Bars"] = "肩甲，20 块瑟银锭",
	["The spiders roam the lava pools and plateaus of the south-west."] = "蜘蛛在西南部的熔岩池和高地上游荡。",
	["The {item:11000}"] = "{item:11000}",
	["The {object:179827} board"] = "{object:179827}布告板",
	["Thorium Brotherhood Reputation"] = "瑟银兄弟会声望",
	["via Iron: 4 Iron Bars"] = "铁锭方案：4块铁锭",
	["via {item:3356}: 4 {item:3356}"] = "使用 {item:3356} 的方案：4 个 {item:3356}",
	["via {item:4234}: 10 {item:4234}"] = "通过 {item:4234}：10 个 {item:4234}。",
	["{area:1443} is the cave in the north of the Cauldron. The {item:18922} lie on a bench on its upper ledge, beside {npc:14621}: a level 50 elite with guards, easy at 60, worth a group below 55. Incendosaurs swim in the lava pools inside and around the north rim; every one drops two to four Incendosaur Scales. Keep every scale: Burninate's turn-ins take two each. If you find {npc:14636}'s ornate pillow in the dwarves' sleeping quarters, take it to {npc:14628} at {area:1446} for 100 more."] = "{area:1443} 是大熔炉北边的洞穴。{item:18922} 放在上层平台的长凳上，就在 {npc:14621} 旁：他是带守卫的 50 级精英，60 级很容易打，低于 55 级值得组队。熏火龙在洞内及北缘周围的熔岩池游动；每只掉落两至四个熏火龙的鳞片。每个鳞片都留着：大铁匠博恩奈特的交还任务每次要两个。如果在矮人寝室找到 {npc:14636} 的华丽枕头，带给 {area:1446} 的 {npc:14628}，再赚 100 点声望。",
	["{area:1446} is the scaffolded camp on the north-west rim of the Cauldron, with a flight point. Everyone starts Neutral with the Brotherhood. These seven quests (level 48 to 50) pay 100 reputation each: 700 in all, 800 with the pillow below. In Classic a quest pays less once it is 6 or more levels below you, only 20 each at 60, so do them while you level through {zone:1427} if you can; your first turn-in shows which. {npc:14624}'s {quest:7722} also opens his {item:18942} turn-ins, so it is needed at any level. The numbers in this guide leave out the Legacy perk Diplomat, which adds up to 10%."] = "{area:1446}是火山口西北缘搭着脚手架的营地，设有飞行点。所有人一开始与兄弟会都是中立。这七个任务（48到50级）各给100点声望：共700点，加上下面提到的枕头为800点。在经典旧世中，任务比你低6级或更多时给的声望会减少，60级时每个只有20点，所以若能，就在练级穿过{zone:1427}时做；你第一次上交就能看出实际给多少。{npc:14624}的{quest:7722}还会开启他的{item:18942}上交，所以任何等级都需要做它。本篇攻略的数字未计入传承特长“外交家”，它最多加10%。",
	["{item:10999}, {npc:9056} inside {area:1584}"] = "{item:10999}，由 {area:1584} 内的 {npc:9056} 掉落。",
	["{item:11370}: Dark Iron Deposits, {skill:186} 230"] = "{item:11370}：黑铁矿脉，需要{skill:186}230",
	["{item:11382}: 200"] = "{item:11382}：200",
	["{item:11382}: Molten Destroyers, sometimes a {object:165658}"] = "{item:11382}：熔核摧毁者，有时来自{object:165658}",
	["{item:17010}: 200"] = "{item:17010}：200",
	["{item:17010}: Firewalkers, Flameguards and Firelords in the {area:2717}"] = "{item:17010}：{area:2717} 的烈焰行者、烈焰卫士和火焰之王",
	["{item:17011}: 200"] = "{item:17011}：200",
	["{item:17011}: Lava Elementals, Lava Reavers and Molten Destroyers"] = "{item:17011}：来自熔岩元素、熔岩掠夺者和熔核摧毁者。",
	["{item:17012}: skin Ancient Core Hounds and Magmadar"] = "{item:17012}：剥取上古熔火恶犬和玛格曼达的皮",
	["{item:17203}, already in your bags"] = "{item:17203}，已经在背包中",
	["{item:18628}, from {npc:12944}"] = "{item:18628}，由{npc:12944}掉落",
	["{item:18942} to Friendly"] = "交还 {item:18942} 至友善",
