}

G["forever/class/druid/aquatic-form"] = {
	["Take the portal up to {npc:4217} in the {area:1658}. {quest:31}: swim fast and breathe underwater."] = "乘传送门上去找{area:1658}里的{npc:4217}。{quest:31}：游得快些，并在水下呼吸。",
}

G["forever/class/druid/aquatic-form"] = {
	["Back through {area:1637} to the zeppelin towers outside its main gate: the zeppelin to the {zone:1458} lands in {zone:1420}, and {zone:1421} is south of the {zone:1458}."] = "穿过{area:1637}回到正门外的飞艇塔：飞往{zone:1458}的飞艇降落在{zone:1420}，而{zone:1421}在{zone:1458}以南。",
	["Cast {spell:18960} to get here: {npc:11802} stands upstairs in the building beside where you land. {quest:28} runs on a 30-minute timer: once you accept it, no teleport or Hearthstone until {npc:11799} has it. Six Bauble Containers (vases) lie in narrow hollows deep on the floor of {area:656} below {area:2361}, often near the bubbling fissures (the {object:177524} in the middle of the lake refills your breath); each comes back three minutes after it is opened, and other druids take them too. Check the {item:15877} is in your bags before you surface: it fades five minutes after you loot it. Swim it straight to the {area:2362} on the north-west shore, use it inside the shrine grounds and speak to {npc:11799} by the tree."] = "施放{spell:18960}来到这里：{npc:11802}就在你降落处旁边那栋楼的楼上。{quest:28}按30分钟计时：一旦接取，在{npc:11799}拿到它之前不能传送或使用炉石。{area:2361}下方的{area:656}深处底部有六个饰物容器（花瓶），藏在狭窄的凹坑里，常在冒泡的裂隙附近（湖中央的{object:177524}能补满呼吸）；每个打开后三分钟刷新，其他德鲁伊也会来拿。浮上水面前确认背包里有{item:15877}：拾取后五分钟它就会消失。直接把它游送到西北岸的{area:2362}，在神龛范围内使用，并与树旁的{npc:11799}交谈。",
	["Cast {spell:18960} to get here: {npc:11802} stands upstairs in the building beside where you land. {quest:29} runs on a 30-minute timer: once you accept it, no teleport or Hearthstone until {npc:11799} has it. Six Bauble Containers (vases) lie in narrow hollows deep on the floor of {area:656} below {area:2361}, often near the bubbling fissures (the {object:177524} in the middle of the lake refills your breath); each comes back three minutes after it is opened, and other druids take them too. Check the {item:15877} is in your bags before you surface: it fades five minutes after you loot it. Swim it straight to the {area:2362} on the north-west shore, use it inside the shrine grounds and speak to {npc:11799} by the tree."] = "施放{spell:18960}来到这里：{npc:11802}就在你降落处旁边那栋楼的楼上。{quest:29}按30分钟计时：一旦接取，在{npc:11799}拿到它之前不能传送或使用炉石。{area:2361}下方的{area:656}深处底部有六个饰物容器（花瓶），藏在狭窄的凹坑里，常在冒泡的裂隙附近（湖中央的{object:177524}能补满呼吸）；每个打开后三分钟刷新，其他德鲁伊也会来拿。浮上水面前确认背包里有{item:15877}：拾取后五分钟它就会消失。直接把它游送到西北岸的{area:2362}，在神龛范围内使用，并与树旁的{npc:11799}交谈。",
	["Take {npc:11798}'s flight to {area:1638} and fly on to {area:1637}. The {object:177792} lies underwater in the {area:382} pond, a short walk out of {area:1637}'s west gate, in front of a wooden wall. The Venture Co. there are quick to join a fight: come in from the west to avoid most of them."] = "乘{npc:11798}的航班到{area:1638}，再继续飞往{area:1637}。{object:177792}在{area:382}池塘的水下，从{area:1637}西门出去走一小段就到，在一堵木墙前。那里的风险投资公司成员很容易加入战斗：从西边进入以避开大部分。",
	["The {object:177790} lies at the bottom of very deep water off the coast north-west of the {area:228}, beside an air fissure where you can breathe: watch your breath on the way down. Then {spell:18960} takes you straight back."] = "{object:177790}在{area:228}西北海岸外的极深水底，紧挨着一处能呼吸的空气裂隙：下潜途中注意呼吸。然后用{spell:18960}直接返回。",
}

G["forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison"] = {
	["Any {npc:6498} counts, the Ironhide and Tyrant Devilsaurs too. They are elite (level 54-55), hit with {spell:14099} and outrun travel form. Grouping up is encouraged, but a druid can do it alone: Hibernate or {spell:339} it from range, stab it with the {item:22432} (the barb does not break {spell:2637}), then leave. The credit counts the moment the barb lands, even if you die after. The arrow points at the plain Devilsaurs of the west and north; an {npc:6499} roams the middle of the crater's south, nearer {npc:9619}."] = "任何{npc:6498}都算，铁皮魔暴龙和霸王魔暴龙也算。它们是54到55级精英，会用{spell:14099}，而且比旅行形态跑得快。建议组队，但德鲁伊也能单干：在远处用休眠或{spell:339}控制它，用{item:22432}刺它一下（倒刺不会打破{spell:2637}），然后离开。倒刺命中的瞬间就算完成，哪怕你随后死亡。箭头指向西边和北边的普通魔暴龙；{npc:6499}在环形山南部中央游荡，离{npc:9619}更近。",
	["Stab a {npc:6498} with the {item:22432}"] = "用{item:22432}刺一头{npc:6498}",
}

G["forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar"] = {
	["The four demons are level 60 elites disguised as friendly travellers; talk to one and say you know what it is, and it turns into its demon form. Fight every one alone: no pet (dismiss it), no other player's heal, buff or attack once the fight starts, or the demon calls you a coward and vanishes, with a 3 hour wait for it to return (also after it dies). Buffs and potions you take before the pull are fine, and a friend may stand by to kill wandering monsters or enemy players, as long as they never touch the demon or you. Bring a {item:9224} ({skill:171} or the auction house), Major Mana Potions for the long kites, and a melee weapon with the Demonslaying enchant if you can. {spell:19878}, from your trainer, shows the disguised demons on the minimap. In a group, set loot to free for all so you can loot the head."] = "这四个恶魔都是60级精英，伪装成友善的旅行者；与其中一个交谈并表明你知道它是什么，它就会变回恶魔形态。每一场都必须单挑：不带宠物（解散它），战斗开始后不能有其他玩家的治疗、增益或攻击，否则恶魔会骂你懦夫并消失，要等3小时才会回来（它死亡后同样如此）。开怪前加的增益和使用药水没问题，朋友也可以在场边帮你清理游荡的怪物或敌对玩家，只要他们不碰恶魔、也不碰你。带上{item:9224}（{skill:171}制作或在拍卖行购买）、用于长时间风筝的强效法力药水，以及一把附有屠魔的武器（如果可以）。训练师处学到的{spell:19878}能在小地图上显示伪装的恶魔。组队时把拾取方式设为自由拾取，这样你才能拾取头颅。",
}

